CREATE OR REPLACE VIEW "viewfilm018a0" AS (/* A材 */ SELECT "a"."單據類別", "a"."單據編號", "a"."單據序號", "b"."製程代碼", "a"."異動類別", "a"."異動日期" AS "單據日期", "c"."文數字1" AS "批號", "a"."最後更新日", "c"."數值1" AS "異動數" FROM "fil0040" AS "a" INNER JOIN "fil0041" AS "c" ON "a"."單據類別" = "c"."單別" AND "a"."單據編號" = "c"."單號" AND "a"."單據序號" = "c"."序號" INNER JOIN "fil0031" AS "b" ON "a"."單據類別" = "b"."單別" AND "a"."單據編號" = "b"."單號" INNER JOIN "fil0043" AS "f" ON "f"."條碼" = "c"."文數字1" WHERE "a"."單據類別" = 'C41' AND "b"."製程代碼" = 'C31E' AND POSITION('^' IN "c"."文數字1") > 0 UNION ALL /* B材 */ SELECT "a"."單據類別", "a"."單據編號", "a"."單據序號", "b"."製程代碼", "a"."異動類別", "a"."異動日期" AS "單據日期", "c"."文數字2" AS "批號", "a"."最後更新日", "c"."數值2" AS "異動數" FROM "fil0040" AS "a" INNER JOIN "fil0041" AS "c" ON "a"."單據類別" = "c"."單別" AND "a"."單據編號" = "c"."單號" AND "a"."單據序號" = "c"."序號" INNER JOIN "fil0031" AS "b" ON "a"."單據類別" = "b"."單別" AND "a"."單據編號" = "b"."單號" INNER JOIN "fil0043" AS "f" ON "f"."條碼" = "c"."文數字2" WHERE "a"."單據類別" = 'C41' AND "b"."製程代碼" = 'C31E' AND POSITION('^' IN "c"."文數字2") > 0 UNION ALL /* 側邊 */ SELECT "a"."單據類別", "a"."單據編號", "a"."單據序號", "b"."製程代碼", "a"."異動類別", "a"."異動日期" AS "單據日期", "c"."文數字3" AS "批號", "a"."最後更新日", "c"."數值3" AS "異動數" FROM "fil0040" AS "a" INNER JOIN "fil0041" AS "c" ON "a"."單據類別" = "c"."單別" AND "a"."單據編號" = "c"."單號" AND "a"."單據序號" = "c"."序號" INNER JOIN "fil0031" AS "b" ON "a"."單據類別" = "b"."單別" AND "a"."單據編號" = "b"."單號" INNER JOIN "fil0043" AS "f" ON "f"."條碼" = "c"."文數字3" WHERE "a"."單據類別" = 'C41' AND "b"."製程代碼" = 'C31E' AND POSITION('^' IN "c"."文數字3") > 0 UNION ALL /* 底邊 */ SELECT "a"."單據類別", "a"."單據編號", "a"."單據序號", "a"."異動類別", "b"."製程代碼", "a"."異動日期" AS "單據日期", CAST("c"."文數字4" AS TEXT) AS "批號", "a"."最後更新日", "c"."數值4" AS "異動數" FROM "fil0040" AS "a" INNER JOIN "fil0041" AS "c" ON "a"."單據類別" = "c"."單別" AND "a"."單據編號" = "c"."單號" AND "a"."單據序號" = "c"."序號" INNER JOIN "fil0031" AS "b" ON "a"."單據類別" = "b"."單別" AND "a"."單據編號" = "b"."單號" INNER JOIN "fil0043" AS "f" ON "f"."條碼" = "c"."文數字4" WHERE "a"."單據類別" = 'C41' AND "b"."製程代碼" = 'C31E' AND POSITION('^' IN "c"."文數字4") > 0 UNION ALL /* 裁切一 */ SELECT "a"."單據類別", "a"."單據編號", "a"."單據序號", "b"."製程代碼", "a"."異動類別", "a"."異動日期" AS "單據日期", CAST("c"."文數字4" AS TEXT) AS "批號", "a"."最後更新日", ("a"."異動數量") AS "異動數" FROM "fil0040" AS "a" INNER JOIN "fil0041" AS "c" ON "a"."單據類別" = "c"."單別" AND "a"."單據編號" = "c"."單號" AND "a"."單據序號" = "c"."序號" INNER JOIN "fil0031" AS "b" ON "a"."單據類別" = "b"."單別" AND "a"."單據編號" = "b"."單號" INNER JOIN "fil0043" AS "f" ON "f"."條碼" = "c"."文數字4" WHERE "a"."單據類別" = 'C41' AND "b"."製程代碼" = 'C31D' AND POSITION('^' IN "c"."文數字4") > 0 UNION ALL /* 裁切二 */ SELECT "a"."單據類別", "a"."單據編號", "a"."單據序號", "b"."製程代碼", "a"."異動類別", "a"."異動日期" AS "單據日期", CAST("c"."文數字5" AS TEXT) AS "批號", "a"."最後更新日", ("a"."數值1") AS "異動數" FROM "fil0040" AS "a" INNER JOIN "fil0041" AS "c" ON "a"."單據類別" = "c"."單別" AND "a"."單據編號" = "c"."單號" AND "a"."單據序號" = "c"."序號" INNER JOIN "fil0031" AS "b" ON "a"."單據類別" = "b"."單別" AND "a"."單據編號" = "b"."單號" INNER JOIN "fil0043" AS "f" ON "f"."條碼" = "c"."文數字4" WHERE "a"."單據類別" = 'C41' AND "b"."製程代碼" = 'C31D' AND POSITION('^' IN "c"."文數字5") > 0);

-- Home #2235 ViewFILM018A1.製/裁半成品領退
CREATE OR REPLACE VIEW "viewfilm018a1" AS (/* A材退庫 */ SELECT "a"."單據類別", "a"."單據編號", "a"."單據序號", "b"."製程代碼", "a"."異動類別", "a"."異動日期" AS "單據日期", "c"."文數字1" AS "批號", "a"."最後更新日", "c"."數值19" AS "異動數" FROM "fil0040" AS "a" INNER JOIN "fil0041" AS "c" ON "a"."單據類別" = "c"."單別" AND "a"."單據編號" = "c"."單號" AND "a"."單據序號" = "c"."序號" INNER JOIN "fil0031" AS "b" ON "a"."單據類別" = "b"."單別" AND "a"."單據編號" = "b"."單號" INNER JOIN "fil0043" AS "f" ON "f"."條碼" = "c"."文數字1" WHERE "a"."單據類別" = 'C41' AND "b"."製程代碼" = 'C31E' AND POSITION('^' IN "c"."文數字1") > 0 AND "c"."數值19" <> 0 UNION ALL /* B材退庫 */ SELECT "a"."單據類別", "a"."單據編號", "a"."單據序號", "b"."製程代碼", "a"."異動類別", "a"."異動日期" AS "單據日期", "c"."文數字2" AS "批號", "a"."最後更新日", "c"."數值20" AS "異動數" FROM "fil0040" AS "a" INNER JOIN "fil0041" AS "c" ON "a"."單據類別" = "c"."單別" AND "a"."單據編號" = "c"."單號" AND "a"."單據序號" = "c"."序號" INNER JOIN "fil0031" AS "b" ON "a"."單據類別" = "b"."單別" AND "a"."單據編號" = "b"."單號" INNER JOIN "fil0043" AS "f" ON "f"."條碼" = "c"."文數字2" WHERE "a"."單據類別" = 'C41' AND "b"."製程代碼" = 'C31E' AND POSITION('^' IN "c"."文數字2") > 0 AND "c"."數值20" <> 0 UNION ALL /* 側邊退庫 */ SELECT "a"."單據類別", "a"."單據編號", "a"."單據序號", "b"."製程代碼", "a"."異動類別", "a"."異動日期" AS "單據日期", "c"."文數字3" AS "批號", "a"."最後更新日", "c"."數值21" AS "異動數" FROM "fil0040" AS "a" INNER JOIN "fil0041" AS "c" ON "a"."單據類別" = "c"."單別" AND "a"."單據編號" = "c"."單號" AND "a"."單據序號" = "c"."序號" INNER JOIN "fil0031" AS "b" ON "a"."單據類別" = "b"."單別" AND "a"."單據編號" = "b"."單號" INNER JOIN "fil0043" AS "f" ON "f"."條碼" = "c"."文數字3" WHERE "a"."單據類別" = 'C41' AND "b"."製程代碼" = 'C31E' AND POSITION('^' IN "c"."文數字3") > 0 AND "c"."數值21" <> 0 UNION ALL /* 底邊退庫 */ SELECT "a"."單據類別", "a"."單據編號", "a"."單據序號", "a"."異動類別", "b"."製程代碼", "a"."異動日期" AS "單據日期", CAST("c"."文數字4" AS TEXT) AS "批號", "a"."最後更新日", "c"."數值22" AS "異動數" FROM "fil0040" AS "a" INNER JOIN "fil0041" AS "c" ON "a"."單據類別" = "c"."單別" AND "a"."單據編號" = "c"."單號" AND "a"."單據序號" = "c"."序號" INNER JOIN "fil0031" AS "b" ON "a"."單據類別" = "b"."單別" AND "a"."單據編號" = "b"."單號" INNER JOIN "fil0043" AS "f" ON "f"."條碼" = "c"."文數字4" WHERE "a"."單據類別" = 'C41' AND "b"."製程代碼" = 'C31E' AND POSITION('^' IN "c"."文數字4") > 0 AND "c"."數值22" <> 0);

-- Home #2210 ViewFILM018SA.條碼領退清單
CREATE OR REPLACE VIEW "viewfilm018sa" AS WITH "tmp1" AS (/* 請領發料 */ SELECT "a"."請領單別", "a"."請領單號", "a"."料號", SUM("a"."核准數量") AS "核准數量", SUM("a"."發料數量") AS "發料數量" FROM (SELECT CASE WHEN "a"."單據類別" = 'C4L' THEN "a"."單據類別" ELSE "b"."歸屬類別" END AS "請領單別", CASE WHEN "a"."單據類別" = 'C4L' THEN "a"."單據編號" ELSE "b"."歸屬編號" END AS "請領單號", CASE WHEN "a"."單據類別" = 'C4L' THEN "a"."產品編號" ELSE "a"."文數字1" END AS "料號", CASE WHEN "a"."單據類別" = 'C4L' THEN "a"."異動數量" ELSE 0 END * "b"."邏輯值一" AS "核准數量", CASE WHEN "a"."單據類別" = 'C4M' THEN "a"."異動數量" ELSE 0 END AS "發料數量" FROM "fil0040" AS "a" INNER JOIN "fil0030" AS "b" ON "a"."單據類別" = "b"."單據類別" AND "a"."單據編號" = "b"."單據編號" /* 特殊欄位 */ INNER JOIN "fil0031" AS "c" ON "a"."單據類別" = "c"."單別" AND "a"."單據編號" = "c"."單號" LEFT JOIN "fil0041" AS "d" ON "a"."單據類別" = "d"."單別" AND "a"."單據編號" = "d"."單號" AND "a"."單據序號" = "d"."序號" WHERE "a"."單據類別" BETWEEN 'C4L' AND 'C4M') AS "a" GROUP BY "a"."請領單別", "a"."請領單號", "a"."料號"), "tmp2" /* 日報領用 */ AS (SELECT 'C4L' AS "請領單別", "e"."其它單號" AS "請領單號", "e"."請領料號" AS "料號", SUM("a"."異動數量") AS "領用數量" FROM "fil0040" AS "a" INNER JOIN "fil0030" AS "b" ON "a"."單據類別" = "b"."單據類別" AND "a"."單據編號" = "b"."單據編號" /* 特殊欄位 */ INNER JOIN "fil0041" AS "c" ON "a"."單據類別" = "c"."單別" AND "a"."單據編號" = "c"."單號" AND "a"."單據序號" = "c"."序號" INNER JOIN "fil0031" AS "d" ON "a"."單據類別" = "d"."單別" AND "a"."單據編號" = "d"."單號" INNER JOIN "fil0044" AS "e" ON "e"."條碼" = CAST("c"."文數字4" AS TEXT) AND "e"."單據類別" = 'C4M' AND "e"."來源" = 'O' WHERE "a"."單據類別" = 'C41' AND "a"."異動數量" > 0 AND (("d"."製程代碼" BETWEEN 'C31A' AND 'C31C') OR "d"."製程代碼" = 'C32D' OR "d"."製程代碼" = 'C31H' OR "d"."製程代碼" = 'C31K') AND "c"."文數字4" <> ' ' GROUP BY "e"."其它單號", "e"."請領料號"), "tmp2a" /* 裁切領用 */ AS (SELECT 'C4L' AS "請領單別", "e"."其它單號" AS "請領單號", "e"."請領料號" AS "料號", SUM("a"."折讓") AS "領用數量" FROM "fil0030" AS "a" /* 特殊欄位 */ INNER JOIN "fil0044" AS "e" ON "e"."條碼" = "a"."廠客單號" AND "e"."單據類別" = 'C4M' AND "e"."來源" = 'O' WHERE "a"."單據類別" = 'E13' AND "a"."折讓" > 0 AND "a"."廠客單號" <> ' ' GROUP BY "e"."其它單號", "e"."請領料號"), "tmp3" /* 日報退回 */ AS (SELECT 'C4L' AS "請領單別", "e"."其它單號" AS "請領單號", "e"."請領料號" AS "料號", SUM("a"."退庫數量" * CASE WHEN "a"."logical1" = 1 THEN 0 ELSE 1 END) AS "退庫數量", SUM("a"."退庫數量" * "a"."logical1") AS "沿用數量" FROM "fil0040" AS "a" INNER JOIN "fil0030" AS "b" ON "a"."單據類別" = "b"."單據類別" AND "a"."單據編號" = "b"."單據編號" /* 特殊欄位 */ INNER JOIN "fil0041" AS "c" ON "a"."單據類別" = "c"."單別" AND "a"."單據編號" = "c"."單號" AND "a"."單據序號" = "c"."序號" INNER JOIN "fil0031" AS "d" ON "a"."單據類別" = "d"."單別" AND "a"."單據編號" = "d"."單號" INNER JOIN "fil0044" AS "e" ON "e"."條碼" = CAST("c"."文數字4" AS TEXT) AND "e"."單據類別" = 'C4M' AND "e"."來源" = 'O' WHERE "a"."單據類別" = 'C41' AND "a"."退庫數量" > 0 AND (("d"."製程代碼" BETWEEN 'C31A' AND 'C31C') OR "d"."製程代碼" = 'C32D' OR "d"."製程代碼" = 'C31H' OR "d"."製程代碼" = 'C31K') AND "c"."文數字4" <> ' ' GROUP BY "e"."其它單號", "e"."請領料號"), "tmp3a" /* 裁切退回 */ AS (SELECT 'C4L' AS "請領單別", "e"."其它單號" AS "請領單號", "e"."請領料號" AS "料號", SUM("d"."數值1") AS "退庫數量" FROM "fil0030" AS "a" /* 特殊欄位 */ INNER JOIN "fil0044" AS "e" ON "e"."條碼" = "a"."廠客單號" AND "e"."單據類別" = 'C4M' AND "e"."來源" = 'O' INNER JOIN "fil0031" AS "d" ON "a"."單據類別" = "d"."單別" AND "a"."單據編號" = "d"."單號" WHERE "a"."單據類別" = 'E13' AND "d"."數值1" > 0 AND "a"."廠客單號" <> ' ' GROUP BY "e"."其它單號", "e"."請領料號") SELECT "a"."請領單別", "a"."請領單號", "a"."料號", SUM("a"."核准數量") AS "請領數量", SUM("a"."發料數量") AS "發料數量", SUM(CAST((COALESCE("b"."領用數量", 0) + COALESCE("d"."領用數量", 0)) AS DOUBLE PRECISION) / 1000) AS "日報領用數量", SUM(CAST((COALESCE("c"."退庫數量", 0) + COALESCE("e"."退庫數量", 0)) AS DOUBLE PRECISION) / 1000) AS "日報退庫數量", SUM(CAST(COALESCE("c"."沿用數量", 0) AS DOUBLE PRECISION) / 1000) AS "日報沿用數量" FROM "tmp1" AS "a" LEFT JOIN "tmp2" AS "b" ON "b"."請領單別" = "a"."請領單別" AND "b"."請領單號" = "a"."請領單號" AND "b"."料號" = "a"."料號" LEFT JOIN "tmp3" AS "c" ON "c"."請領單別" = "a"."請領單別" AND "c"."請領單號" = "a"."請領單號" AND "c"."料號" = "a"."料號" LEFT JOIN "tmp2a" AS "d" ON "d"."請領單別" = "a"."請領單別" AND "d"."請領單號" = "a"."請領單號" AND "d"."料號" = "a"."料號" LEFT JOIN "tmp3a" AS "e" ON "e"."請領單別" = "a"."請領單別" AND "e"."請領單號" = "a"."請領單號" AND "e"."料號" = "a"."料號" GROUP BY "a"."請領單別", "a"."請領單號", "a"."料號";

-- Home #2211 ViewFILM018SB.條碼退庫明細
CREATE OR REPLACE VIEW "viewfilm018sb" AS WITH "tmp0" AS (SELECT "a"."單據類別" AS "請領單別", "a"."單據編號" AS "請領單號", "a"."產品編號" AS "料號", "a"."異動數量" * "b"."邏輯值一" AS "異動數量", "a"."單據類別" AS "來源單別", "a"."單據編號" AS "來源單號", "a"."單據序號" AS "來源序號", ' ' AS "批號", ' ' AS "製令單別", ' ' AS "製令單號", '1.請領' AS "來源" FROM "fil0040" AS "a" INNER JOIN "fil0030" AS "b" ON "a"."單據類別" = "b"."單據類別" AND "a"."單據編號" = "b"."單據編號" /* 特殊欄位 */ INNER JOIN "fil0031" AS "c" ON "a"."單據類別" = "c"."單別" AND "a"."單據編號" = "c"."單號" LEFT JOIN "fil0041" AS "d" ON "a"."單據類別" = "d"."單別" AND "a"."單據編號" = "d"."單號" AND "a"."單據序號" = "d"."序號" WHERE "a"."單據類別" = 'C4L'), "tmp1" AS (SELECT "b"."歸屬類別" AS "請領單別", "b"."歸屬編號" AS "請領單號", "a"."文數字1" AS "料號", "a"."異動數量" AS "異動數量", "a"."單據類別" AS "來源單別", "a"."單據編號" AS "來源單號", "a"."單據序號" AS "來源序號", "d"."批號", ' ' AS "製令單別", ' ' AS "製令單號", '2.發料' AS "來源" FROM "fil0040" AS "a" INNER JOIN "fil0030" AS "b" ON "a"."單據類別" = "b"."單據類別" AND "a"."單據編號" = "b"."單據編號" /* 特殊欄位 */ INNER JOIN "fil0031" AS "c" ON "a"."單據類別" = "c"."單別" AND "a"."單據編號" = "c"."單號" LEFT JOIN "fil0041" AS "d" ON "a"."單據類別" = "d"."單別" AND "a"."單據編號" = "d"."單號" AND "a"."單據序號" = "d"."序號" WHERE "a"."單據類別" = 'C4M'), "tmp2" /* 日報領用 */ AS (SELECT 'C4L' AS "請領單別", "e"."其它單號" AS "請領單號", "e"."請領料號" AS "料號", "a"."異動數量" AS "異動數量", "a"."單據類別" AS "來源單別", "a"."單據編號" AS "來源單號", "a"."單據序號" AS "來源序號", CAST("c"."文數字4" AS TEXT) AS "批號", CASE WHEN "d"."製程代碼" = 'C31H' THEN "a"."前置單別" WHEN "d"."製程代碼" = 'C31K' THEN "a"."前置單別" ELSE "b"."歸屬類別" END AS "製令單別", CASE WHEN "d"."製程代碼" = 'C31H' THEN "a"."前置單號" WHEN "d"."製程代碼" = 'C31K' THEN "a"."前置單號" ELSE "b"."歸屬編號" END AS "製令單號", '3.領用' AS "來源" FROM "fil0040" AS "a" INNER JOIN "fil0030" AS "b" ON "a"."單據類別" = "b"."單據類別" AND "a"."單據編號" = "b"."單據編號" /* 特殊欄位 */ INNER JOIN "fil0041" AS "c" ON "a"."單據類別" = "c"."單別" AND "a"."單據編號" = "c"."單號" AND "a"."單據序號" = "c"."序號" INNER JOIN "fil0031" AS "d" ON "a"."單據類別" = "d"."單別" AND "a"."單據編號" = "d"."單號" INNER JOIN "fil0044" AS "e" ON "e"."條碼" = CAST("c"."文數字4" AS TEXT) AND "e"."單據類別" = 'C4M' AND "e"."來源" = 'O' WHERE "a"."單據類別" = 'C41' AND "a"."異動數量" > 0 AND (("d"."製程代碼" BETWEEN 'C31A' AND 'C31C') OR "d"."製程代碼" = 'C32D' OR "d"."製程代碼" = 'C31H' OR "d"."製程代碼" = 'C31K') AND "c"."文數字4" <> ' '), "tmp3" /* 日報退回 */ AS (SELECT 'C4L' AS "請領單別", "e"."其它單號" AS "請領單號", "e"."請領料號" AS "料號", "a"."退庫數量" AS "異動數量", "a"."單據類別" AS "來源單別", "a"."單據編號" AS "來源單號", "a"."單據序號" AS "來源序號", CAST("c"."文數字4" AS TEXT) AS "批號", CASE WHEN "d"."製程代碼" = 'C31H' THEN "a"."前置單別" WHEN "d"."製程代碼" = 'C31K' THEN "a"."前置單別" ELSE "b"."歸屬類別" END AS "製令單別", CASE WHEN "d"."製程代碼" = 'C31H' THEN "a"."前置單號" WHEN "d"."製程代碼" = 'C31K' THEN "a"."前置單號" ELSE "b"."歸屬編號" END AS "製令單號", '4.退回' AS "來源" FROM "fil0040" AS "a" INNER JOIN "fil0030" AS "b" ON "a"."單據類別" = "b"."單據類別" AND "a"."單據編號" = "b"."單據編號" /* 特殊欄位 */ INNER JOIN "fil0041" AS "c" ON "a"."單據類別" = "c"."單別" AND "a"."單據編號" = "c"."單號" AND "a"."單據序號" = "c"."序號" INNER JOIN "fil0031" AS "d" ON "a"."單據類別" = "d"."單別" AND "a"."單據編號" = "d"."單號" INNER JOIN "fil0044" AS "e" ON "e"."條碼" = CAST("c"."文數字4" AS TEXT) AND "e"."單據類別" = 'C4M' AND "e"."來源" = 'O' WHERE "a"."單據類別" = 'C41' AND "a"."退庫數量" > 0 AND (("d"."製程代碼" BETWEEN 'C31A' AND 'C31C') OR "d"."製程代碼" = 'C32D' OR "d"."製程代碼" = 'C31H' OR "d"."製程代碼" = 'C31K') AND "c"."文數字4" <> ' ') SELECT * FROM "tmp0" UNION ALL SELECT * FROM "tmp1" UNION ALL SELECT * FROM "tmp2" UNION ALL SELECT * FROM "tmp3";

-- Home #2212 ViewFILM018SC.條碼日報領退
CREATE OR REPLACE VIEW "viewfilm018sc" AS /* 日報領用 */ SELECT 'C4L' AS "請領單別", "e"."其它單號" AS "請領單號", "a"."單據編號" AS "日報單號", "e"."請領料號" AS "料號", CASE WHEN "d"."製程代碼" = 'C31H' THEN "a"."前置單別" WHEN "d"."製程代碼" = 'C31K' THEN "a"."前置單別" ELSE "b"."歸屬類別" END AS "製令單別", CASE WHEN "d"."製程代碼" = 'C31H' THEN "a"."前置單號" WHEN "d"."製程代碼" = 'C31K' THEN "a"."前置單號" ELSE "b"."歸屬編號" END AS "製令單號", CAST("c"."文數字4" AS TEXT) AS "批號", "a"."異動數量" AS "領用數量", "a"."退庫數量" * CASE WHEN "a"."logical1" = 1 THEN 0 ELSE 1 END AS "退庫數量", "a"."退庫數量" * "a"."logical1" AS "沿用數量", CONCAT("e"."異動日期", "e"."異動時間") AS "異動日時", "a"."logical1" AS "沿用", "d"."製程代碼" FROM "fil0040" AS "a" INNER JOIN "fil0030" AS "b" ON "a"."單據類別" = "b"."單據類別" AND "a"."單據編號" = "b"."單據編號" /* 特殊欄位 */ INNER JOIN "fil0041" AS "c" ON "a"."單據類別" = "c"."單別" AND "a"."單據編號" = "c"."單號" AND "a"."單據序號" = "c"."序號" INNER JOIN "fil0031" AS "d" ON "a"."單據類別" = "d"."單別" AND "a"."單據編號" = "d"."單號" INNER JOIN "fil0044" AS "e" ON "e"."條碼" = CAST("c"."文數字4" AS TEXT) AND "e"."單據類別" = 'C4M' AND "e"."來源" = 'O' WHERE "a"."單據類別" = 'C41' AND ("a"."異動數量" > 0 OR "a"."退庫數量" > 0) AND (("d"."製程代碼" BETWEEN 'C31A' AND 'C31C') OR "d"."製程代碼" = 'C32D' OR "d"."製程代碼" = 'C31H' OR "d"."製程代碼" = 'C31K') AND "c"."文數字4" <> ' ' UNION ALL /* 裁切領用 */ SELECT 'C4L' AS "請領單別", "e"."其它單號" AS "請領單號", "a"."單據編號" AS "日報單號", "e"."請領料號" AS "料號", 'C11' AS "製令單別", 'Z' AS "製令單號", CAST("a"."廠客單號" AS TEXT) AS "批號", "a"."折讓" AS "領用數量", "d"."數值1" AS "退庫數量", 0 AS "沿用數量", CONCAT("e"."異動日期", "e"."異動時間") AS "異動日時", 0 AS "沿用", ' ' FROM "fil0030" AS "a" /* 特殊欄位 */ INNER JOIN "fil0044" AS "e" ON "e"."條碼" = "a"."廠客單號" AND "e"."單據類別" = 'C4M' AND "e"."來源" = 'O' INNER JOIN "fil0031" AS "d" ON "a"."單據類別" = "d"."單別" AND "a"."單據編號" = "d"."單號" WHERE "a"."單據類別" = 'E13' AND ("a"."折讓" > 0 OR "d"."數值1" > 0) AND "a"."廠客單號" <> ' ';

-- Home #2254 ViewFILM102.材料庫存月彙總
CREATE OR REPLACE VIEW "viewfilm102" AS (SELECT "a"."年月", "a"."料號", "a"."來源", SUM("a"."異動數") AS "數量", SUM("a"."異動金額") AS "金額" FROM "fil004n" AS "a" GROUP BY "a"."年月", "a"."料號", "a"."來源");

-- Home #2255 ViewFILM103.材料庫存月料號
CREATE OR REPLACE VIEW "viewfilm103" AS (SELECT "a"."年月", "a"."料號" FROM "fil004n" AS "a");

-- Home #2256 ViewFILM104.材料進耗存月彙總
CREATE OR REPLACE VIEW "viewfilm104" AS (SELECT DISTINCT "a"."年月", "a"."料號", COALESCE("b"."數量", 0) AS "期初數量", COALESCE("b"."金額", 0) AS "期初金額", COALESCE("c"."數量", 0) AS "進貨數量", COALESCE("c"."金額", 0) AS "進貨金額", CASE WHEN (COALESCE("b"."數量", 0) + COALESCE("c"."數量", 0)) = 0 THEN 0 ELSE CAST((COALESCE("b"."金額", 0) + COALESCE("c"."金額", 0)) AS DOUBLE PRECISION) / (COALESCE("b"."數量", 0) + COALESCE("c"."數量", 0)) END AS "平均單價", COALESCE("d"."數量", 0) AS "耗用數量", COALESCE("d"."數量", 0) * CASE WHEN (COALESCE("b"."數量", 0) + COALESCE("c"."數量", 0)) = 0 THEN 0 ELSE CAST((COALESCE("b"."金額", 0) + COALESCE("c"."金額", 0)) AS DOUBLE PRECISION) / (COALESCE("b"."數量", 0) + COALESCE("c"."數量", 0)) END AS "耗用金額", COALESCE("b"."數量", 0) + COALESCE("c"."數量", 0) + COALESCE("c"."數量", 0) AS "期末數量", (COALESCE("b"."數量", 0) + COALESCE("c"."數量", 0) + COALESCE("c"."數量", 0)) * CASE WHEN (COALESCE("b"."數量", 0) + COALESCE("c"."數量", 0)) = 0 THEN 0 ELSE CAST((COALESCE("b"."金額", 0) + COALESCE("c"."金額", 0)) AS DOUBLE PRECISION) / (COALESCE("b"."數量", 0) + COALESCE("c"."數量", 0)) END AS "期末金額" FROM "viewfilm102" AS "a" LEFT JOIN "viewfilm102" AS "b" ON "a"."年月" = "b"."年月" AND "a"."料號" = "b"."料號" AND "b"."來源" = '1.期初庫存' LEFT JOIN "viewfilm102" AS "c" ON "a"."年月" = "c"."年月" AND "a"."料號" = "c"."料號" AND "c"."來源" = '2.本期進貨' LEFT JOIN "viewfilm102" AS "d" ON "a"."年月" = "d"."年月" AND "a"."料號" = "d"."料號" AND "d"."來源" = '4.領料');

-- Home #2260 ViewFILM112.客供品庫存月彙總
CREATE OR REPLACE VIEW "viewfilm112" AS (SELECT "a"."年月", "a"."料號", "a"."來源", SUM("a"."異動數") AS "數量", SUM("a"."異動金額") AS "金額" FROM "fil004o" AS "a" GROUP BY "a"."年月", "a"."料號", "a"."來源");

-- Home #2261 ViewFILM113.客供品庫存月料號
CREATE OR REPLACE VIEW "viewfilm113" AS (SELECT "a"."年月", "a"."料號" FROM "fil004o" AS "a");

-- Home #2263 ViewFILM202.製程直接人工(實薪)
CREATE OR REPLACE VIEW "viewfilm202" AS /* 前製程 */ WITH "temp1" AS (SELECT ORA_SUBSTR("a"."單據日期", 1, 6) AS "年月", "b"."製程代碼", SUM((COALESCE("w"."實際直接人工時薪", 0) + COALESCE("x"."實際直接人工時薪", 0) + COALESCE("y"."實際直接人工時薪", 0) + COALESCE("z"."實際直接人工時薪", 0)) * CASE WHEN "b"."時間五" = '000000' THEN 0 ELSE (TO_DATE(CONCAT(TO_CHAR(CASE WHEN "b"."時間五" > "b"."時間一" THEN TO_DATE("a"."單據日期", 'yyyymmdd') ELSE TO_DATE("a"."單據日期", 'yyyymmdd') + 1 END, 'yyyymmdd'), "b"."時間五"), 'yyyymmddhh24miss') - TO_DATE(CONCAT(TRIM("a"."單據日期"), "b"."時間一"), 'yyyymmddhh24miss')) * 24 END) AS "實際直接人工" FROM "fil0030" AS "a" INNER JOIN "fil0031" AS "b" ON "a"."單據類別" = "b"."單別" AND "a"."單據編號" = "b"."單號" LEFT JOIN "viewfilhs02" AS "w" ON ORA_SUBSTR("w"."年月", 1, 6) = ORA_SUBSTR("a"."單據日期", 1, 6) AND "w"."員工編號" = "a"."業務員" LEFT JOIN "viewfilhs02" AS "x" ON ORA_SUBSTR("x"."年月", 1, 6) = ORA_SUBSTR("a"."單據日期", 1, 6) AND "x"."員工編號" = "b"."文數字10" LEFT JOIN "viewfilhs02" AS "y" ON ORA_SUBSTR("y"."年月", 1, 6) = ORA_SUBSTR("a"."單據日期", 1, 6) AND "y"."員工編號" = "b"."文數字11" LEFT JOIN "viewfilhs02" AS "z" ON ORA_SUBSTR("z"."年月", 1, 6) = ORA_SUBSTR("a"."單據日期", 1, 6) AND "z"."員工編號" = CASE WHEN "b"."製程代碼" = 'C31E' THEN ' ' ELSE "b"."文數字12" END WHERE "a"."單據類別" = 'C41' AND "a"."單據日期" > '2025' AND ("b"."製程代碼" BETWEEN 'C31A' AND 'C31G' OR "b"."製程代碼" = 'C32D' OR "b"."製程代碼" = 'C32I') GROUP BY ORA_SUBSTR("a"."單據日期", 1, 6), "b"."製程代碼" UNION ALL SELECT ORA_SUBSTR("a"."單據日期", 1, 6) AS "年月", "b"."製程代碼", SUM((COALESCE("w"."實際直接人工時薪", 0) + COALESCE("x"."實際直接人工時薪", 0) + COALESCE("y"."實際直接人工時薪", 0) + COALESCE("z"."實際直接人工時薪", 0)) * CASE WHEN "b"."時間五" = '000000' THEN 0 ELSE (TO_DATE(CONCAT(TO_CHAR(CASE WHEN "b"."時間五" > "b"."時間一" THEN TO_DATE("a"."單據日期", 'yyyymmdd') ELSE TO_DATE("a"."單據日期", 'yyyymmdd') + 1 END, 'yyyymmdd'), "b"."時間五"), 'yyyymmddhh24miss') - TO_DATE(CONCAT(TRIM("a"."單據日期"), "b"."時間一"), 'yyyymmddhh24miss')) * 24 END) AS "實際直接人工" FROM "fil0030" AS "a" INNER JOIN "fil0031" AS "b" ON "a"."單據類別" = "b"."單別" AND "a"."單據編號" = "b"."單號" LEFT JOIN "viewfilhs02" AS "w" ON ORA_SUBSTR("w"."年月", 1, 6) = ORA_SUBSTR("a"."單據日期", 1, 6) AND "w"."員工編號" = "a"."業務員" LEFT JOIN "viewfilhs02" AS "x" ON ORA_SUBSTR("x"."年月", 1, 6) = ORA_SUBSTR("a"."單據日期", 1, 6) AND "x"."員工編號" = "b"."文數字10" LEFT JOIN "viewfilhs02" AS "y" ON ORA_SUBSTR("y"."年月", 1, 6) = ORA_SUBSTR("a"."單據日期", 1, 6) AND "y"."員工編號" = "b"."文數字11" LEFT JOIN "viewfilhs02" AS "z" ON ORA_SUBSTR("z"."年月", 1, 6) = ORA_SUBSTR("a"."單據日期", 1, 6) AND "z"."員工編號" = "b"."文數字12" WHERE "a"."單據類別" = 'C41' AND "a"."單據日期" > '2025' AND ("b"."製程代碼" = 'C31H' OR "b"."製程代碼" = 'C31K') GROUP BY ORA_SUBSTR("a"."單據日期", 1, 6), "b"."製程代碼") SELECT "a"."年月", "a"."製程代碼", "a"."實際直接人工", COALESCE("b"."分攤直接人工", 0) AS "分攤直接人工" FROM "temp1" AS "a" LEFT JOIN (SELECT "a"."年月", "a"."製程代碼", SUM(CASE WHEN "a"."成本類別" = 'A' THEN ("a"."本月應發金額" - "a"."事病假薪點" - "a"."遲到早退扣支" - "a"."調補扣支") ELSE 0 END) AS "分攤直接人工" FROM "viewfilhs02" AS "a" GROUP BY "a"."年月", "a"."製程代碼") AS "b" ON ORA_SUBSTR("a"."年月", 1, 6) = ORA_SUBSTR("b"."年月", 1, 6) AND "a"."製程代碼" = "b"."製程代碼";

-- Home #2318 ViewFILR002.客訴單明細
CREATE OR REPLACE VIEW "viewfilr002" AS (SELECT "a"."單據類別" AS "單別", "a"."單據編號" AS "單號", "a"."單據序號" AS "序號", "a"."前置單別" AS "製令單別", "a"."前置單號" AS "製令單號", "a"."產品編號", COALESCE("e"."客戶報價品名", ' ') AS "產品名稱", COALESCE("e"."客戶報價規格", ' ') AS "產品規格", COALESCE("e"."文數字4", ' ') AS "材質結構", COALESCE("e"."文字1", ' ') AS "交貨備註", COALESCE("e"."文字2", ' ') AS "異常備註", COALESCE("d"."規格", ' ') AS "成品規格", "a"."異動日期" AS "交貨日期", "a"."異動數量" AS "交貨數量", "a"."贈品數量" AS "異常數量", "a"."單位代碼" AS "單位代碼", COALESCE("f1"."名稱", ' ') AS "單位名稱", "a"."倉庫代碼" AS "異常單位代碼", COALESCE("f1"."名稱", ' ') AS "異常單位名稱", "c"."廠客編號" AS "客戶編號", "a"."流水編號", "a"."最後更新者", COALESCE("z1"."員工姓名", ' ') AS "更新者姓名", "a"."最後更新日" FROM "fil0040" AS "a" INNER JOIN "fil0032" AS "b" ON "a"."前置單別" = "b"."製令單別" AND "a"."前置單號" = "b"."製令單號" INNER JOIN "fil0030" AS "c" ON "a"."前置單別" = "c"."單據類別" AND "a"."前置單號" = "c"."單據編號" LEFT JOIN "fil0012" AS "d" ON "b"."產品編號" = "d"."產品編號" LEFT JOIN "fil0041" AS "e" ON "a"."單據類別" = "e"."單別" AND "a"."單據編號" = "e"."單號" AND "a"."單據序號" = "e"."序號" LEFT JOIN "viewfil3103" AS "f1" ON "a"."單位代碼" = "f1"."代碼" LEFT JOIN "viewfil3103" AS "f2" ON "a"."倉庫代碼" = "f2"."代碼" LEFT JOIN "fil0010" AS "z1" ON "a"."最後更新者" = "z1"."員工編號" WHERE "a"."單據類別" = 'R01' AND "a"."單據編號" <> ' ');

-- Home #2321 ViewFILR012.品質異常合計
CREATE OR REPLACE VIEW "viewfilr012" AS (SELECT "a"."單據類別" AS "單別", "a"."單據編號" AS "單號", SUM("a"."異動數量") AS "生產總量", SUM(CASE WHEN "a"."logical3" = 0 THEN "a"."贈品數量" END) AS "異常數量", CASE WHEN SUM("a"."異動數量") = 0 THEN 0 ELSE ROUND(CAST(SUM(CASE WHEN "a"."logical3" = 0 THEN "a"."贈品數量" END) AS DOUBLE PRECISION) / SUM("a"."異動數量") * 100, 3) END AS "不良率", SUM(CASE WHEN "a"."logical3" = 1 THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS "待確認筆數", SUM(CASE WHEN "a"."單位代碼" = CAST("a"."相關代碼1" AS TEXT) OR "a"."相關代碼1" = ' ' THEN 0 ELSE 1 END) AS "單位不同", ' ' AS "總產量單位" FROM "fil0040" AS "a" WHERE "a"."單據類別" = 'R02' GROUP BY "a"."單據類別", "a"."單據編號");

-- Home #2322 ViewFILR013.品質異常單位當月
CREATE OR REPLACE VIEW "viewfilr013" AS (SELECT "a"."異常單位", ORA_SUBSTR("b"."單據日期", 1, 6) AS "異常年月", COALESCE("e"."部門名稱", ' ') AS "異常單位名稱", COUNT(*) AS "異常次數", CONCAT("a"."異常單位", ORA_SUBSTR("b"."單據日期", 1, 6)) AS "單位年月" FROM "fil003l1" AS "a" INNER JOIN "fil0030" AS "b" ON "a"."單別" = "b"."單據類別" AND "a"."單號" = "b"."單據編號" LEFT JOIN "fil0020" AS "e" ON "a"."異常單位" = "e"."部門編號" GROUP BY "a"."異常單位", ORA_SUBSTR("b"."單據日期", 1, 6), COALESCE("e"."部門名稱", ' '));

-- Home #2329 ViewFILR021.銷退處理表明細
CREATE OR REPLACE VIEW "viewfilr021" AS (SELECT "a"."單據類別" AS "單別", "a"."單據編號" AS "單號", "a"."單據序號" AS "序號", "a"."前置單別" AS "製令單別", "a"."前置單號" AS "製令單號", "a"."產品編號", "a"."文數字1" AS "產品名稱", "a"."備註說明", "a"."異動數量" AS "數量", "c"."廠客編號" AS "客戶編號", "a"."單位代碼", COALESCE("f1"."名稱", ' ') AS "單位名稱", "a"."流水編號", "a"."最後更新者", COALESCE("z1"."員工姓名", ' ') AS "更新者姓名", "a"."最後更新日" FROM "fil0040" AS "a" INNER JOIN "fil0032" AS "b" ON "a"."前置單別" = "b"."製令單別" AND "a"."前置單號" = "b"."製令單號" INNER JOIN "fil0030" AS "c" ON "a"."前置單別" = "c"."單據類別" AND "a"."前置單號" = "c"."單據編號" LEFT JOIN "viewfil3103" AS "f1" ON "a"."單位代碼" = "f1"."代碼" LEFT JOIN "fil0010" AS "z1" ON "a"."最後更新者" = "z1"."員工編號" WHERE "a"."單據類別" = 'R03');

-- Home #2313 ViewOfA01
CREATE OR REPLACE VIEW "viewofa01" AS SELECT "a"."serial_num" AS "流水編號", "a"."owner" AS "開單人流水號", "a"."applyby" AS "申請人流水號", TO_DATE("a"."createdate", 'yyyymmdd') AS "開單日期", "a"."duedate" AS "簽核期限", ORA_SUBSTR("a"."serial_num", 1, 3) AS "表單代碼" FROM "a01" AS "a" WHERE "a"."createdate" BETWEEN CAST(CURRENT_TIMESTAMP - 100 AS TEXT) AND CAST(CURRENT_TIMESTAMP AS TEXT);

-- edb #109 Create ViewOfAccNoteTemp
CREATE OR REPLACE VIEW "viewofaccnotetemp" ("type", "job_type", "subjectno", "dc", "content") AS SELECT 'M', "a20_5"."job_type", "a20_5"."科目代號", "a20_5"."借貸", "a20_5"."參考欄位" FROM "a20_5" UNION SELECT 'D', "a20_4"."doccode", "a20_4"."科目代號", "a20_4"."借貸", "a01_7"."content" FROM "a01_7", "a20_4" WHERE ORA_SUBSTR("a01_7"."serial_num", 1, 3) = "a20_4"."doccode" AND "a01_7"."defined_seq" = "a20_4"."serial_num_seq" AND "a20_4"."科目代號" <> ' ';

-- edb #122 CreatListView
CREATE OR REPLACE VIEW "viewofcal" ("userid", "serialno", "datefrom", "listitem") AS SELECT "calendar"."userid", "serialno", "datefrom", "subject" FROM "calendar";

-- Home #2351 Create ViewOfDeptTree
CREATE OR REPLACE VIEW "viewofdepttree" ("parentid", "nodeid") AS SELECT 'All', ' ' UNION SELECT ' ', "a30"."serial_num" FROM "a30";

-- Home #2345 Create ViewOfFlowDetail
CREATE OR REPLACE VIEW "viewofflowdetail" ("type", "serialno", "empserialno", "folderstatus", "flowstatus", "signorcc", "itemno") AS /* 單據屬性:申請人 */ SELECT 'A', "a01"."serial_num", "a01"."applyby", "a01"."flowstatus", 'A', 1, 0 FROM "a01" UNION /* 單據屬性:開單人 */ SELECT 'B', "a01"."serial_num", "a01"."owner", "a01"."flowstatus", 'A', 1, 0 FROM "a01" UNION /* 單據流程:應簽 */ SELECT 'C', "a"."serial_num", "a"."assignedto", "b"."flowstatus", (CASE WHEN "a"."signedtype" = '2' THEN 'R' WHEN "a"."signedtype" = '1' THEN 'A' ELSE 'I' END), "a"."signorcc", "a"."serial_num_seq" FROM "a01_2" AS "a" INNER JOIN "a01" AS "b" ON "a"."serial_num" = "b"."serial_num" LEFT JOIN "a01_2" AS "c" ON "a"."serial_num" = "c"."serial_num" AND "a"."version" = "c"."serial_num_seq" UNION /* 單據流程:簽核 */ SELECT 'D', "a01_2"."serial_num", "a01_2"."signedby", "a01"."flowstatus", (CASE WHEN "a01_2"."signedtype" = '2' THEN 'R' WHEN "a01_2"."signedtype" = '1' THEN 'A' ELSE 'I' END), "a01_2"."signorcc", "a01_2"."serial_num_seq" FROM "a01_2", "a01" WHERE "a01_2"."serial_num" = "a01"."serial_num" AND "a01_2"."signedby" <> ' ' AND "a01_2"."assignedto" <> "a01_2"."signedby" UNION /* 單據流程:退簽 */ SELECT 'E', "a"."serial_num", "a"."signbackto", "b"."flowstatus", (CASE WHEN "a"."signedtype" = '2' THEN 'R' WHEN "a"."signedtype" = '1' THEN 'A' ELSE 'I' END), "a"."signorcc", "a"."serial_num_seq" FROM "a01_2" AS "a" INNER JOIN "a01" AS "b" ON "a"."serial_num" = "b"."serial_num" LEFT JOIN "a01_2" AS "c" ON "a"."serial_num" = "c"."serial_num" AND "a"."version" = "c"."serial_num_seq";

-- Home #2361 Create ViewOfFlowType
CREATE OR REPLACE VIEW "viewofflowtype" AS SELECT "job_type" AS "表單代碼", "類別代碼", "說明", CONCAT("類別代碼", '.', "說明") AS "代碼說明" FROM "a20_8";

-- Home #2344 Create ViewOfGroupDoc
CREATE OR REPLACE VIEW "viewofgroupdoc" ("groupserialno", "docserialno", "job_type", "docname") AS SELECT "a30_2"."serial_num", "a30_2"."docserialno", "a20"."job_type", "a20"."guname" FROM "a30_2", "a20" WHERE "a30_2"."docserialno" = "a20"."serial_num" AND "a20"."表單類別" BETWEEN '1' AND '2' UNION SELECT 'SUPERVISOR', "a20"."serial_num", "a20"."job_type", "a20"."guname" FROM "a20" WHERE "a20"."表單類別" BETWEEN '1' AND '2' UNION SELECT "a30"."serial_num", "a20"."serial_num", "a20"."job_type", "a20"."guname" FROM "a30", "a07", "a20" WHERE "a07"."programid" = "a20"."job_type" AND "a07"."forall" = 1 AND "a20"."表單類別" BETWEEN '1' AND '2';

-- Home #2347 Create ViewOfGroupDocID
CREATE OR REPLACE VIEW "viewofgroupdocid" ("groupserialno", "programid", "programname") AS SELECT "viewofgroupdoc"."groupserialno", "a07"."programid", CONCAT("a07"."programid", ' ', "a20"."guname") FROM "viewofgroupdoc", "a07", "a20" WHERE "viewofgroupdoc"."job_type" = "viewofgroupdoc"."job_type" AND "a07"."programid" = "a20"."job_type" AND "a07"."forall" = '1' UNION SELECT "a30_2"."serial_num", "a20"."job_type", CONCAT("a20"."job_type", ' ', "a20"."guname") FROM "a30_2", "a20" WHERE "a30_2"."docserialno" = "a20"."serial_num";

-- Home #2350 Create ViewOfIMAlive
CREATE OR REPLACE VIEW "viewofimalive" AS (SELECT "formessage" AS "來源訊息", COUNT("serial_num") AS "筆數" FROM "messages" WHERE "ending" = 0 AND "messages"."formessage" <> ' ' AND "類型" = 'R' GROUP BY "formessage");

-- Home #2312 ViewOfIMNotEnd
CREATE OR REPLACE VIEW "viewofimnotend" AS SELECT "m"."messageto" AS "收訊人", "a"."員工編號", COUNT("m"."serial_num") AS "未結案筆數" FROM "messages" AS "m" INNER JOIN "fil0010" AS "a" ON "a"."serial_num" = "m"."messageto" INNER JOIN "fil0010" AS "c" ON "c"."serial_num" = "m"."createby" LEFT JOIN "viewofimalive" AS "b" ON "m"."serial_num" = "b"."來源訊息" WHERE "m"."imflag" = 1 AND "m"."ending" /* 含未回覆
	(M.Ending = 0 or nvl(筆數,0) > 0)  and
	*/ = 0 AND "m"."類型" <> 'R' AND "m"."invaliddate" > TO_CHAR(CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, 'yyyymmdd') GROUP BY "m"."messageto", "a"."員工編號";

-- Home #2348 Create ViewOfMsgNotRep
CREATE OR REPLACE VIEW "viewofmsgnotrep" ("相關單據", "流水編號", "發訊人", "收訊人") AS SELECT "m"."refdocument", "m"."serial_num", "m"."createby", "m"."messageto" FROM "messages" AS "m" WHERE "m"."ending" = 0 AND "m"."類型" = 'Q' AND NOT "m"."serial_num" IN (SELECT "d"."formessage" FROM "messages" AS "d" WHERE "d"."createby" = "m"."messageto" AND "d"."refdocument" = "m"."refdocument" AND "d"."formessage" = "m"."serial_num");

-- Home #2362 Create ViewOfMsgRepList
CREATE OR REPLACE VIEW "viewofmsgreplist" AS SELECT "messages"."formessage" AS "來源訊息", "messages"."messageto" AS "收訊人", STRING_AGG(CAST(TRIM("messages"."message") AS TEXT), ',' ORDER BY "messages"."formessage", "messages"."messageto") AS "回覆內容" FROM "messages" WHERE "messages"."類型" = 'R' AND "messages"."formessage" <> ' ' GROUP BY "messages"."formessage", "messages"."messageto";

-- Home #2342 Create ViewOfObj
CREATE OR REPLACE VIEW "viewofobj" ("serialno", "objid", "objname") AS SELECT "a20"."serial_num", "a20"."job_type", "a20"."guname" FROM "a20", "a01" WHERE "a20"."serial_num" = "a01"."serial_num" AND "a01"."flowstatus" = 'E';

-- Home #2355 Create ViewOfObjProperties
CREATE OR REPLACE VIEW "viewofobjproperties" AS SELECT "serial_num" AS "單據流水號", "name" AS "單據名稱", "flowstatus" AS "簽核狀態", TO_TIMESTAMP(CONCAT("createdate", "createtime"), 'YYYYMMDDHH24MISS') AS "送簽日時" FROM "a01";

-- Home #2346 Create ViewOfObjQueryID
CREATE OR REPLACE VIEW "viewofobjqueryid" ("serialno", "emp_serinalno", "version") AS SELECT DISTINCT "a01"."serial_num", "a01"."owner", "a01"."version" FROM "a01" UNION SELECT DISTINCT "a01"."serial_num", "a01"."applyby", "a01"."version" FROM "a01" UNION SELECT DISTINCT "a01_2"."serial_num", "a01_2"."assignedto", "a01_2"."version" FROM "a01_2" UNION SELECT DISTINCT "a01_2"."serial_num", "a01_2"."signedby", "a01_2"."version" FROM "a01_2";

-- Home #2352 Create ViewOfSubDept
CREATE OR REPLACE VIEW "viewofsubdept" ("parentid", "nodeid") AS SELECT 'All', ' ' UNION SELECT ' ', "a30"."serial_num" FROM "a30" UNION SELECT "a35"."groupid", "a35"."serial_num" FROM "a35";

-- Home #2343 Create ViewOfSysCode
CREATE OR REPLACE VIEW "viewofsyscode" ("serialno", "codetype", "codeid", "codename") AS SELECT "a10"."serial_num", "a10"."codetype", "a10"."codeid", "a10"."guname" FROM "a10", "a01" WHERE "a10"."serial_num" = "a01"."serial_num" AND "a01"."flowstatus" = 'E';

-- Home #2353 Create ViewOfSysCode1
CREATE OR REPLACE VIEW "viewofsyscode1" ("parentid", "nodeid") AS SELECT 'All', ' ' UNION SELECT ' ', TO_CHAR("a10"."codeid", 'yyyymmdd') FROM "a10" WHERE "codetype" = '文件類別';

-- Home #2360 Create ViewOfValidAssignee
CREATE OR REPLACE VIEW "viewofvalidassignee" AS SELECT "serial_num", "asignee", "datefrom", "dateto" FROM "a60_7" WHERE TO_CHAR(CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, 'YYYYMMDD') BETWEEN "a60_7"."datefrom" AND "a60_7"."dateto";

-- DOC #56 ViewDoc_ShareFolder
CREATE OR REPLACE VIEW "viewdoc_sharefolder" AS (SELECT DISTINCT CAST(' ' AS VARCHAR(100)) AS "createdby", CAST(' ' AS VARCHAR(100)) AS "parentid", CAST('分享文件' AS VARCHAR(100)) AS "文件夾", "a"."userid" FROM "viewdoc_userrights" AS "a" INNER JOIN "doc_docbytool" AS "b" ON "a"."objid" = "b"."objid" AND "b"."deleted" = 0 INNER JOIN "doc_kmtree" AS "c" ON "b"."category" = "c"."category" AND "b"."nodeid" = "c"."nodeid" INNER JOIN "doc_jobstatus" AS "d" ON "a"."objid" = "d"."objid" AND "d"."status" = 'U' UNION ALL SELECT DISTINCT CAST('分享文件' AS VARCHAR(100)) AS "createdby", CAST('分享文件' AS VARCHAR(100)) AS "parentid", CAST(COALESCE("e"."員工姓名", "b"."createdby") AS VARCHAR(100)) AS "文件夾", "a"."userid" FROM "viewdoc_userrights" AS "a" INNER JOIN "doc_docbytool" AS "b" ON "a"."objid" = "b"."objid" AND "b"."deleted" = 0 INNER JOIN "doc_kmtree" AS "c" ON "b"."category" = "c"."category" AND "b"."nodeid" = "c"."nodeid" INNER JOIN "doc_jobstatus" AS "d" ON "a"."objid" = "d"."objid" AND "d"."status" = 'U' LEFT JOIN "viewfil1010" AS "e" ON "b"."createdby" = "e"."員工編號" UNION ALL SELECT DISTINCT CAST(COALESCE("e"."員工姓名", "b"."createdby") AS VARCHAR(100)) AS "createdby", CAST(COALESCE("e"."員工姓名", "b"."createdby") AS VARCHAR(100)) AS "parentid", CAST(CONCAT("b"."category", '#', ORA_SUBSTR("b"."nodeid", 1, 2)) AS VARCHAR(100)) AS "文件夾", "a"."userid" FROM "viewdoc_userrights" AS "a" INNER JOIN "doc_docbytool" AS "b" ON "a"."objid" = "b"."objid" AND "b"."deleted" = 0 INNER JOIN "doc_jobstatus" AS "d" ON "a"."objid" = "d"."objid" AND "d"."status" = 'U' LEFT JOIN "viewfil1010" AS "e" ON "b"."createdby" = "e"."員工編號" UNION ALL SELECT DISTINCT CAST(COALESCE("e"."員工姓名", "b"."createdby") AS VARCHAR(100)) AS "createdby", CAST(CONCAT("b"."category", '#', ORA_SUBSTR("b"."nodeid", 1, 2)) AS VARCHAR(100)) AS "parentid", CAST(CONCAT("b"."category", '#', ORA_SUBSTR("b"."nodeid", 1, 5)) AS VARCHAR(100)) AS "文件夾", "a"."userid" FROM "viewdoc_userrights" AS "a" INNER JOIN "doc_docbytool" AS "b" ON "a"."objid" = "b"."objid" AND "b"."deleted" = 0 INNER JOIN "doc_jobstatus" AS "d" ON "a"."objid" = "d"."objid" AND "d"."status" = 'U' LEFT JOIN "viewfil1010" AS "e" ON "b"."createdby" = "e"."員工編號" WHERE LENGTH(TRIM("b"."nodeid")) > 2 UNION ALL SELECT DISTINCT CAST(COALESCE("e"."員工姓名", "b"."createdby") AS VARCHAR(100)) AS "createdby", CAST(CONCAT("b"."category", '#', ORA_SUBSTR("b"."nodeid", 1, 5)) AS VARCHAR(100)) AS "parentid", CAST(CONCAT("b"."category", '#', ORA_SUBSTR("b"."nodeid", 1, 8)) AS VARCHAR(100)) AS "文件夾", "a"."userid" FROM "viewdoc_userrights" AS "a" INNER JOIN "doc_docbytool" AS "b" ON "a"."objid" = "b"."objid" AND "b"."deleted" = 0 INNER JOIN "doc_jobstatus" AS "d" ON "a"."objid" = "d"."objid" AND "d"."status" = 'U' LEFT JOIN "viewfil1010" AS "e" ON "b"."createdby" = "e"."員工編號" WHERE LENGTH(TRIM("b"."nodeid")) > 5 UNION ALL SELECT DISTINCT CAST(COALESCE("e"."員工姓名", "b"."createdby") AS VARCHAR(100)) AS "createdby", CAST(CONCAT("b"."category", '#', ORA_SUBSTR("b"."nodeid", 1, 8)) AS VARCHAR(100)) AS "parentid", CAST(CONCAT("b"."category", '#', "b"."nodeid") AS VARCHAR(100)) AS "文件夾", "a"."userid" FROM "viewdoc_userrights" AS "a" INNER JOIN "doc_docbytool" AS "b" ON "a"."objid" = "b"."objid" AND "b"."deleted" = 0 INNER JOIN "doc_jobstatus" AS "d" ON "a"."objid" = "d"."objid" AND "d"."status" = 'U' LEFT JOIN "viewfil1010" AS "e" ON "b"."createdby" = "e"."員工編號" WHERE LENGTH(TRIM("b"."nodeid")) > 8);

-- DOC #57 ViewDoc_ShareObj
CREATE OR REPLACE VIEW "viewdoc_shareobj" AS (SELECT CAST(CONCAT("b"."createdby", '.', "c"."subject") AS VARCHAR(50)) AS "文件夾", "a"."userid", "a"."objid", "a"."read_" AS "讀取", "a"."modify_" AS "修改", "a"."delete_" AS "刪除" FROM "viewdoc_userrights" AS "a" INNER JOIN "doc_docbytool" AS "b" ON "a"."objid" = "b"."objid" AND "b"."deleted" = 0 INNER JOIN "doc_kmtree" AS "c" ON "b"."category" = "c"."category" AND "b"."nodeid" = "c"."nodeid" INNER JOIN "doc_jobstatus" AS "d" ON "a"."objid" = "d"."objid" AND "d"."status" = 'U');

-- Home #1752 ViewFIL1014.廠商資料檔
CREATE OR REPLACE VIEW "viewfil1014" AS (SELECT "a"."編號", "a"."全名", "a"."簡稱", "a"."關係人代號", "a"."憑證列印格式", "a"."統一編號", "a"."核准狀況", CASE WHEN "a"."核准狀況" = '1' THEN '已核准' ELSE '其他' END AS "核准狀況名稱", "a"."電話一", "a"."電話二", "a"."傳真", "a"."email", "a"."負責人", "a"."聯絡人一", "a"."聯絡人二", "a"."聯絡人三", "a"."採購人員", COALESCE("k"."員工姓名", ' ') AS "採購人員姓名", "a"."備註", "a"."總公司", "a"."總公司收款", "a"."會計傳真", "a"."交易項目", "a"."區域代號", COALESCE("l"."名稱", ' ') AS "區域名稱", "a"."國別代號", COALESCE("m"."名稱", ' ') AS "國別名稱", "a"."廠商分類", COALESCE("n"."名稱", ' ') AS "廠商分類名稱", "a"."開業日", "a"."資本額", "a"."員工數", "a"."交易幣別", COALESCE("o"."名稱", ' ') AS "交易幣別名稱", "a"."稅額計算方式", CASE WHEN "a"."稅額計算方式" = '1' THEN '整張資料計算' WHEN "a"."稅額計算方式" = '2' THEN '單身單筆資料計算' ELSE '其他' END AS "稅額計算方式名稱", "a"."單身多稅率", "a"."單據發送方式" AS "採購單發送方式", CASE WHEN "a"."單據發送方式" = '1' THEN '郵寄' WHEN "a"."單據發送方式" = '2' THEN 'FAX' WHEN "a"."單據發送方式" = '4' THEN 'eMail' ELSE '其他' END AS "採購單發送方式名稱", "a"."訂金比率", "a"."允許分批交貨", "a"."收付類別" AS "付款方式", CASE WHEN "a"."收付類別" = '1' THEN '現金' WHEN "a"."收付類別" = '2' THEN '電匯' WHEN "a"."收付類別" = '3' THEN '支票' WHEN "a"."收付類別" = '4' THEN '其他' END AS "付款方式名稱", "a"."收付方式" AS "付款條件", COALESCE("d"."名稱", ' ') AS "付款條件名稱", "a"."價格條件", "a"."匯款總行", "a"."匯款銀行", COALESCE("e"."機構名稱", ' ') AS "銀行名稱", "a"."匯款帳號", "a"."交易條件", CASE WHEN "a"."交易條件" = '1' THEN '一般' ELSE '其他' END AS "交易條件名稱", "a"."票據寄領", CASE WHEN "a"."票據寄領" = '1' THEN '郵寄' WHEN "a"."票據寄領" = '3' THEN '其他' END AS "票據寄領名稱", "a"."稅別代碼", COALESCE("f"."名稱", ' ') AS "稅別名稱", "a"."發票類別" AS "發票聯數", COALESCE("g"."名稱", ' ') AS "發票聯數名稱", "a"."課稅別", CASE WHEN "a"."課稅別" = '2' THEN '應稅外加' WHEN "a"."課稅別" = '3' THEN '零稅率' WHEN "a"."課稅別" = '4' THEN '免稅' WHEN "a"."課稅別" = '9' THEN '不計稅' ELSE '其他' END AS "課稅別名稱", "a"."應收付款科目" AS "應付帳款科目", COALESCE("h"."科目名稱", ' ') AS "帳款科目名稱", "a"."加工費用科目", COALESCE("i"."科目名稱", ' ') AS "費用科目名稱", "a"."應收付票科目" AS "應付票據科目", COALESCE("j"."科目名稱", ' ') AS "票據科目名稱", "a"."abc等級", "a"."交貨評等", "a"."品質評等", "a"."匯至ebc", "a"."ebc申請代號", "a"."聯絡郵區一", "a"."聯絡地址一", "a"."聯絡郵區二", "a"."聯絡地址二", "a"."帳單郵區一", "a"."帳單地址一", "a"."帳單郵區二", "a"."帳單地址二", "a"."隨貨附發票", "a"."版次", "a"."核准日期", "a"."結帳日", "a"."個月逢", "a"."報價自動回覆", "a"."報價聯絡人", "a"."報價email", "a"."驗報自動回覆", "a"."驗報聯絡人", "a"."驗報email", "a"."設計圖自動回覆", "a"."設計圖聯絡人", "a"."設計圖email", "a"."流水編號", "a"."建立員工", COALESCE("b"."員工姓名", ' ') AS "建立員工姓名", "a"."建立日期", "a"."最後更新者", COALESCE("c"."員工姓名", ' ') AS "更新者姓名", "a"."最後更新日" FROM "fil0011" AS "a" LEFT JOIN "fil0010" AS "b" ON "a"."建立員工" = "b"."員工編號" LEFT JOIN "fil0010" AS "c" ON "a"."最後更新者" = "c"."員工編號" LEFT JOIN "viewfil3107" AS "d" ON "a"."收付方式" = "d"."代碼" LEFT JOIN "fil0021" AS "e" ON "a"."匯款總行" = "e"."總機構代碼" AND "a"."匯款銀行" = "e"."分支機構代碼" AND "e"."分支機構代碼" <> ' ' LEFT JOIN "viewfil310e" AS "f" ON "a"."稅別代碼" = "f"."代碼" LEFT JOIN "viewfil3104" AS "g" ON "a"."發票類別" = "g"."代碼" LEFT JOIN "fil0018" AS "h" ON "a"."應收付款科目" = "h"."科目代碼" LEFT JOIN "fil0018" AS "i" ON "a"."加工費用科目" = "i"."科目代碼" LEFT JOIN "fil0018" AS "j" ON "a"."應收付票科目" = "j"."科目代碼" LEFT JOIN "fil0010" AS "k" ON "a"."採購人員" = "k"."員工編號" LEFT JOIN "viewfil310f" AS "l" ON "a"."區域代號" = "l"."代碼" LEFT JOIN "viewfil310g" AS "m" ON "a"."國別代號" = "m"."代碼" LEFT JOIN "viewfil310h" AS "n" ON "a"."廠商分類" = "n"."代碼" LEFT JOIN "viewfil3102" AS "o" ON "a"."交易幣別" = "o"."代碼" WHERE "a"."廠客" = '1');

-- Home #1753 ViewFIL1015.客戶資料檔
CREATE OR REPLACE VIEW "viewfil1015" AS (SELECT "a"."編號", "a"."全名", "a"."英文名稱", "a"."簡稱", "a"."關係人代號", "a"."負責人", "a"."聯絡人一", "a"."聯絡人二", "a"."電話一", "a"."電話二", "a"."分機一", "a"."分機二", "a"."傳真", "a"."email", "a"."統一編號", "a"."資本額", "a"."年營業額", "a"."員工數", "a"."總公司" AS "總店號", "a"."總公司收款" AS "總公司請款", "a"."發票號碼依總公司控管", "a"."合約訂單是否歸屬總公司", "a"."分店數", "a"."交易幣別", COALESCE("o"."名稱", ' ') AS "交易幣別名稱", "a"."部門別", COALESCE("p"."部門名稱", ' ') AS "部門名稱", "a"."採購人員" AS "業務人員", COALESCE("k"."員工姓名", ' ') AS "業務人員姓名", "a"."收款業務", COALESCE("q"."員工姓名", ' ') AS "收款業務姓名", "a"."開業日", "a"."歇業日", "a"."登記郵區一", "a"."登記地址一", "a"."登記郵區二", "a"."登記地址二", "a"."發票郵區一", "a"."發票地址一", "a"."發票郵區二", "a"."發票地址二", "a"."送貨郵區一", "a"."送貨地址一", "a"."送貨郵區二", "a"."送貨地址二", "a"."帳單郵區一", "a"."帳單收件人", "a"."帳單地址一", "a"."帳單郵區二", "a"."帳單地址二", "a"."信用額度依總公司控管", "a"."信用額度管制", "a"."信用額度", "a"."可超出率", "a"."訂單信用查核方式", CASE WHEN "a"."訂單信用查核方式" = '1' THEN '不檢查' ELSE '其他' END AS "訂單信用查核方式名稱", "a"."出貨通知信用查核方式", CASE WHEN "a"."出貨通知信用查核方式" = '1' THEN '不檢查' ELSE '其他' END AS "出貨通知信用查核方式名稱", "a"."銷貨信用查核方式", CASE WHEN "a"."銷貨信用查核方式" = '1' THEN '不檢查' ELSE '其他' END AS "銷貨信用查核方式名稱", "a"."暫出單信用查核方式", CASE WHEN "a"."暫出單信用查核方式" = '1' THEN '不檢查' ELSE '其他' END AS "暫出單信用查核方式名稱", "a"."收付方式" AS "付款條件", COALESCE("d"."名稱", ' ') AS "付款條件名稱", "a"."稅額計算方式", CASE WHEN "a"."稅額計算方式" = '1' THEN '整張資料計算' WHEN "a"."稅額計算方式" = '2' THEN '單身單筆資料計算' ELSE '其他' END AS "稅額計算方式名稱", "a"."單身多稅率", "a"."隨貨附發票", "a"."訂金比率", "a"."價格條件", "a"."稅別代碼", COALESCE("f"."名稱", ' ') AS "稅別名稱", "a"."發票類別" AS "發票聯數", COALESCE("g"."名稱", ' ') AS "發票聯數名稱", "a"."課稅別", CASE WHEN "a"."課稅別" = '2' THEN '應稅外加' WHEN "a"."課稅別" = '3' THEN '零稅率' WHEN "a"."課稅別" = '4' THEN '免稅' WHEN "a"."課稅別" = '9' THEN '不計稅' ELSE '其他' END AS "課稅別名稱", "a"."通關方式", CASE WHEN "a"."通關方式" = '1' THEN '非經海關' WHEN "a"."通關方式" = '2' THEN '經海關' ELSE '其他' END AS "通關方式名稱", "a"."單據發送方式", CASE WHEN "a"."單據發送方式" = '1' THEN '郵寄' WHEN "a"."單據發送方式" = '2' THEN 'FAX' WHEN "a"."單據發送方式" = '4' THEN 'eMail' ELSE '其他' END AS "單據發送方式名稱", "a"."收付類別" AS "收款方式", CASE WHEN "a"."收付類別" = '1' THEN '現金' WHEN "a"."收付類別" = '2' THEN '電匯' WHEN "a"."收付類別" = '3' THEN '支票' WHEN "a"."收付類別" = '4' THEN '其他' END AS "收款方式名稱", "a"."票據寄領", CASE WHEN "a"."票據寄領" = '1' THEN '郵寄' WHEN "a"."票據寄領" = '3' THEN '其他' END AS "票據寄領名稱", "a"."客戶型態", COALESCE("r"."名稱", ' ') AS "型態名稱", "a"."區域代號", COALESCE("l"."名稱", ' ') AS "區域名稱", "a"."國別代號", COALESCE("m"."名稱", ' ') AS "國別名稱", "a"."取價順序", "a"."折扣率", "a"."折扣率預設", "a"."匯至ebc", "a"."ebc申請代號", "a"."結帳日", "a"."匯款總行" AS "付款總行一", "a"."匯款銀行" AS "付款銀行一", COALESCE("e"."機構名稱", ' ') AS "銀行名稱一", "a"."匯款帳號" AS "銀行帳號一", "a"."付款總行二", "a"."付款銀行二", COALESCE("s"."機構名稱", ' ') AS "銀行名稱二", "a"."銀行帳號二", "a"."付款總行三", "a"."付款銀行三", COALESCE("t"."機構名稱", ' ') AS "銀行名稱三", "a"."銀行帳號三", "a"."應收付款科目" AS "帳款科目", COALESCE("h"."科目名稱", ' ') AS "帳款科目名稱", "a"."應收付票科目" AS "票據科目", COALESCE("j"."科目名稱", ' ') AS "票據科目名稱", "a"."備註", "a"."運輸方式", CASE WHEN "a"."運輸方式" = '1' THEN '空運' WHEN "a"."運輸方式" = '2' THEN '海運' WHEN "a"."運輸方式" = '3' THEN '海空聯運' WHEN "a"."運輸方式" = '4' THEN '郵寄' WHEN "a"."運輸方式" = '5' THEN '陸運' WHEN "a"."運輸方式" = '7' THEN '自送' WHEN "a"."運輸方式" = '8' THEN '快遞' ELSE '其他' END AS "運輸方式名稱", "a"."交易條件", CASE WHEN "a"."交易條件" = '1' THEN '一般' ELSE '其他' END AS "交易條件名稱", "a"."文件郵區一", "a"."文件地址一", "a"."文件郵區二", "a"."文件地址二", "a"."版次", "a"."核准日期", "a"."報價自動回覆", "a"."報價聯絡人", "a"."報價email", "a"."驗報自動回覆", "a"."驗報聯絡人", "a"."驗報email", "a"."設計圖自動回覆", "a"."設計圖聯絡人", "a"."設計圖email", "a"."流水編號", "a"."建立員工", COALESCE("b"."員工姓名", ' ') AS "建立員工姓名", "a"."建立日期", "a"."最後更新者", COALESCE("c"."員工姓名", ' ') AS "更新者姓名", "a"."最後更新日" FROM "fil0011" AS "a" LEFT JOIN "fil0010" AS "b" ON "a"."建立員工" = "b"."員工編號" LEFT JOIN "fil0010" AS "c" ON "a"."最後更新者" = "c"."員工編號" LEFT JOIN "viewfil3108" AS "d" ON "a"."收付方式" = "d"."代碼" LEFT JOIN "fil0021" AS "e" ON "a"."匯款總行" = "e"."總機構代碼" AND "a"."匯款銀行" = "e"."分支機構代碼" AND "e"."分支機構代碼" <> ' ' LEFT JOIN "viewfil310e" AS "f" ON "a"."稅別代碼" = "f"."代碼" LEFT JOIN "viewfil3104" AS "g" ON "a"."發票類別" = "g"."代碼" LEFT JOIN "fil0018" AS "h" ON "a"."應收付款科目" = "h"."科目代碼" LEFT JOIN "fil0018" AS "j" ON "a"."應收付票科目" = "j"."科目代碼" LEFT JOIN "fil0010" AS "k" ON "a"."採購人員" = "k"."員工編號" LEFT JOIN "viewfil310f" AS "l" ON "a"."區域代號" = "l"."代碼" LEFT JOIN "viewfil310g" AS "m" ON "a"."國別代號" = "m"."代碼" LEFT JOIN "viewfil3102" AS "o" ON "a"."交易幣別" = "o"."代碼" LEFT JOIN "fil0020" AS "p" ON "a"."部門別" = "p"."部門編號" LEFT JOIN "fil0010" AS "q" ON "a"."收款業務" = "q"."員工編號" LEFT JOIN "viewfil310i" AS "r" ON "a"."客戶型態" = "r"."代碼" LEFT JOIN "fil0021" AS "s" ON "a"."付款總行二" = "s"."總機構代碼" AND "a"."付款銀行二" = "s"."分支機構代碼" AND "s"."分支機構代碼" <> ' ' LEFT JOIN "fil0021" AS "t" ON "a"."付款總行三" = "t"."總機構代碼" AND "a"."付款銀行三" = "t"."分支機構代碼" AND "t"."分支機構代碼" <> ' ' WHERE "a"."廠客" = '2');

-- Home #1756 ViewFIL1017.單位換算檔
CREATE OR REPLACE VIEW "viewfil1017" AS (SELECT "a"."從", COALESCE("c"."名稱", ' ') AS "從名稱", "a"."到", COALESCE("d"."名稱", ' ') AS "到名稱", "a"."換算率", "a"."正反向", "a"."最後更新者", COALESCE("b"."員工姓名", ' ') AS "更新者姓名", "a"."最後更新日" FROM (SELECT "a"."從", "a"."到", "a"."換算率", '+' AS "正反向", "a"."最後更新者", "a"."最後更新日" FROM "fil0017" AS "a" UNION SELECT "a"."到" AS "從", "a"."從" AS "到", ROUND(CAST(1 AS DOUBLE PRECISION) / "a"."換算率", 6) AS "換算率", '-' AS "正反向", "a"."最後更新者", "a"."最後更新日" FROM "fil0017" AS "a" WHERE "a"."到" <> "a"."從") AS "a" LEFT JOIN "fil0010" AS "b" ON "a"."最後更新者" = "b"."員工編號" LEFT JOIN "viewfil3103" AS "c" ON "a"."從" = "c"."代碼" LEFT JOIN "viewfil3103" AS "d" ON "a"."到" = "d"."代碼");

-- Home #1758 ViewFIL1019.採購單價檔
CREATE OR REPLACE VIEW "viewfil1019" AS (SELECT "a"."物料編號", COALESCE("b"."品名", ' ') AS "物料品名", "a"."廠商編號", COALESCE("c"."全名", ' ') AS "廠商全名", "a"."廠商料號", "a"."幣別代碼", COALESCE("d"."名稱", ' ') AS "幣別名稱", "a"."價格條件", "a"."採購單位", COALESCE("f"."名稱", ' ') AS "單位名稱", "a"."單價", "a"."最大供量", "b"."採購人", COALESCE("e"."員工姓名", ' ') AS "採購人姓名", "a"."建立員工", COALESCE("z1"."員工姓名", ' ') AS "建立姓名", "a"."建立日期", "a"."最後更新者", COALESCE("z2"."員工姓名", ' ') AS "更新者姓名", "a"."最後更新日" FROM "fil0019" AS "a" INNER JOIN "fil0012" AS "b" ON "a"."物料編號" = "b"."產品編號" INNER JOIN "fil0011" AS "c" ON "a"."廠商編號" = "c"."編號" LEFT JOIN "viewfil3102" AS "d" ON "a"."幣別代碼" = "d"."代碼" LEFT JOIN "fil0010" AS "e" ON "b"."採購人" = "e"."員工編號" LEFT JOIN "viewfil3103" AS "f" ON "a"."採購單位" = "f"."代碼" LEFT JOIN "fil0010" AS "z1" ON "a"."建立員工" = "z1"."員工編號" LEFT JOIN "fil0010" AS "z2" ON "a"."最後更新者" = "z2"."員工編號");

-- Home #1760 ViewFIL1022.匯率資料檔
CREATE OR REPLACE VIEW "viewfil1022" AS (SELECT "a"."幣別代碼", COALESCE("c"."名稱", ' ') AS "幣別名稱", "a"."匯率日期", "a"."現鈔匯率", "a"."一般匯率", "a"."出口匯率", "a"."進口匯率", "a"."啟用", "a"."即期買入", "a"."即期賣出", "a"."平均匯率", "a"."月平均匯率", "a"."海關買進", "a"."海關賣出", "a"."最後更新者", COALESCE("b"."員工姓名", ' ') AS "更新者姓名", "a"."最後更新日" FROM "fil0022" AS "a" LEFT JOIN "fil0010" AS "b" ON "b"."員工編號" = "a"."最後更新者" LEFT JOIN "viewfil3102" AS "c" ON "c"."代碼" = "a"."幣別代碼");

-- Home #1761 ViewFIL1022.月平均匯率a
CREATE OR REPLACE VIEW "viewfil1022a" AS (SELECT "a"."幣別代碼", COALESCE("b"."名稱", ' ') AS "幣別名稱", "a"."匯率月份", ROUND((CAST("a"."即期買入" AS DOUBLE PRECISION) / "a"."筆數"), 4) AS "即期買入", ROUND((CAST("a"."即期賣出" AS DOUBLE PRECISION) / "a"."筆數"), 4) AS "即期賣出", ROUND(CAST(("a"."即期買入" + "a"."即期賣出") AS DOUBLE PRECISION) / ("a"."筆數" * 2), 4) AS "月平均匯率" FROM (SELECT "a"."幣別代碼", "a"."匯率月份", COUNT("a"."匯率月份") AS "筆數", SUM("a"."即期買入") AS "即期買入", SUM("a"."即期賣出") AS "即期賣出" FROM (SELECT "a"."幣別代碼", ORA_SUBSTR("a"."匯率日期", 1, 6) AS "匯率月份", "a"."即期買入", "a"."即期賣出" FROM "fil0022" AS "a" WHERE "a"."啟用" = 1) AS "a" GROUP BY "a"."幣別代碼", "a"."匯率月份") AS "a" INNER JOIN "viewfil3102" AS "b" ON "a"."幣別代碼" = "b"."代碼");

-- Home #1762 ViewFIL1023.費用項目檔
CREATE OR REPLACE VIEW "viewfil1023" AS (SELECT "a"."費用代碼", "a"."費用名稱", "a"."幣別代碼", COALESCE("b"."名稱", ' ') AS "幣別名稱", "a"."金額", "a"."稅額", "a"."付款條件", COALESCE("c"."名稱", ' ') AS "付款條件名稱", "a"."建立員工", COALESCE("z1"."員工姓名", ' ') AS "建立姓名", "a"."建立日期", "a"."最後更新者", COALESCE("z2"."員工姓名", ' ') AS "更新者姓名", "a"."最後更新日" FROM "fil0023" AS "a" LEFT JOIN "viewfil3102" AS "b" ON "a"."幣別代碼" = "b"."代碼" LEFT JOIN "viewfil3107" AS "c" ON "a"."付款條件" = "c"."代碼" LEFT JOIN "fil0010" AS "z1" ON "a"."建立員工" = "z1"."員工編號" LEFT JOIN "fil0010" AS "z2" ON "a"."最後更新者" = "z2"."員工編號");

-- Home #1775 ViewFIL1024L.條碼油墨簡檔
CREATE OR REPLACE VIEW "viewfil1024l" AS (SELECT "a"."條碼", "a"."日期", "a"."廠商料號" AS "製令單號", "a"."料號", "a"."廠商批號" AS "油墨配比", "a"."廠商規格" AS "色順", "a"."製造日期" AS "製造日期", "a"."驗收倉" AS "機台號碼", CASE WHEN COALESCE("b"."來源", ' ') = ' ' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END AS "庫存數", "a"."單別", "a"."單號", "a"."序號", "a"."qrno", "a"."guid" AS "產品名稱", "a"."選擇" AS "加白墨", COALESCE("z1"."員工姓名", ' ') AS "填表人姓名", "a"."填表日" AS "調色日時", COALESCE("b"."來源", ' ') AS "狀態" FROM "fil0043" AS "a" LEFT JOIN (SELECT "a"."批號", MAX("a"."來源") AS "來源" FROM "viewfil404a3a" AS "a" GROUP BY "a"."批號") AS "b" ON "b"."批號" = "a"."條碼" LEFT JOIN "fil0010" AS "z1" ON "a"."填表人" = "z1"."員工編號" WHERE "a"."批次匯入" = 1 AND "a"."條碼" LIKE 'C31A%');

-- Home #1778 ViewFIL1027.版銅履歷檔
CREATE OR REPLACE VIEW "viewfil1027" AS (SELECT "a"."單據類別", CAST("a"."單據編號" AS TEXT) AS "單據編號", "a"."異動日期", "a"."最後更新日", CAST("a"."產品編號" AS TEXT) AS "版銅編號", CAST(CASE WHEN "a"."單位代碼" = 'A' THEN '取版' ELSE '回收' END AS TEXT) AS "異動類別", CAST("a"."前置單別" AS TEXT) AS "歸屬單別", CAST("a"."前置單號" AS TEXT) AS "歸屬單號", CASE WHEN "a"."單位代碼" = 'A' THEN ' ' ELSE "a"."倉庫代碼" END AS "庫別代碼", 0 AS "送修", 0 AS "回廠", "a"."最後更新者" AS "作業人員", COALESCE("d"."員工姓名", ' ') AS "作業人員姓名", CAST('1' AS TEXT) AS "來源", 0 AS "庫存相關" FROM "fil0040" AS "a" INNER JOIN "fil0031" AS "b" ON "a"."單據類別" = "b"."單別" AND "a"."單據編號" = "b"."單號" INNER JOIN "fil0030" AS "c" ON "a"."單據類別" = "c"."單據類別" AND "a"."單據編號" = "c"."單據編號" LEFT JOIN "fil0010" AS "d" ON "d"."員工編號" = "a"."最後更新者" WHERE "a"."單據類別" = 'C41' AND "b"."製程代碼" = 'C32E' AND "a"."單位代碼" BETWEEN 'A' AND 'B' UNION ALL SELECT "a"."單據類別", CAST("a"."單據編號" AS TEXT) AS "單據編號", "c"."單據日期", "a"."最後更新日", CAST("a"."產品編號" AS TEXT) AS "版銅編號", CAST('送修' AS TEXT) AS "異動類別", CAST('F34' AS TEXT) AS "歸屬單別", CAST("a"."文數字1" AS TEXT) AS "歸屬單號", ' ' AS "庫別代碼", 0 AS "送修申請", 0 AS "回廠", "a"."最後更新者" AS "作業人員", COALESCE("d"."員工姓名", ' ') AS "作業人員姓名", CAST('2' AS TEXT) AS "來源", 0 AS "庫存相關" FROM "fil0040" AS "a" INNER JOIN "fil0030" AS "c" ON "a"."單據類別" = "c"."單據類別" AND "a"."單據編號" = "c"."單據編號" LEFT JOIN "fil0010" AS "d" ON "d"."員工編號" = "a"."最後更新者" WHERE "a"."單據類別" = 'F33' UNION ALL SELECT ' ' AS "單據類別", CAST(CONCAT("a"."版銅代碼", ':', "a"."入庫日期", "a"."入庫時間") AS TEXT) AS "單據編號", COALESCE(CASE WHEN "a"."送修" = 0 THEN "a"."入庫日期" ELSE "c"."異動日期" END, ' ') AS "異動日期", "a"."最後更新日", CAST("a"."版銅代碼" AS TEXT) AS "版銅編號", CAST(CASE WHEN "a"."送修" = 0 THEN CASE WHEN POSITION('送修' IN "a"."歸屬流水編號") = 0 THEN '入庫' ELSE '入庫(送修)' END ELSE CASE WHEN "a"."回廠" = 0 THEN '出廠未回' ELSE '出廠已回' END END AS TEXT) AS "異動類別", CASE WHEN COALESCE("c"."單據編號", ' ') = ' ' THEN ' ' ELSE CAST('F33' AS TEXT) END AS "歸屬單別", CAST(COALESCE("c"."單據編號", ' ') AS TEXT) AS "歸屬單號", "a"."庫別代碼", "a"."送修", "a"."回廠", "a"."最後更新者" AS "作業人員", COALESCE("d"."員工姓名", ' ') AS "作業人員姓名", CAST('3' AS TEXT) AS "來源", CASE WHEN "a"."送修" = 0 THEN 1 ELSE 0 END AS "庫存相關" FROM "fil004d" AS "a" LEFT JOIN "fil0040" AS "c" ON "c"."單據類別" = 'F33' AND "a"."歸屬流水編號" = "c"."流水編號" LEFT JOIN "fil0010" AS "d" ON "d"."員工編號" = "a"."最後更新者" UNION ALL SELECT ' ' AS "單據類別", CONCAT(CAST("a"."版銅代碼" AS TEXT), ' ', TO_CHAR("a"."最後更新日", 'yyyymmdd'), TO_CHAR("a"."序號", '0000000000')) AS "單據編號", TO_CHAR("a"."最後更新日", 'yyyymmdd') AS "異動日期", "a"."最後更新日", CAST("a"."版銅代碼" AS TEXT) AS "版銅編號", CAST(CASE WHEN "a"."類別" = 'A' THEN '洗版開始' WHEN "a"."類別" = 'B' THEN '洗版' WHEN "a"."類別" = 'C' THEN '停用' ELSE ' ' END AS TEXT) AS "異動類別", ' ' AS "歸屬單別", "a"."歸屬代碼" AS "歸屬單號", ' ' AS "庫別代碼", 0 AS "送修", 0 AS "回廠", "a"."最後更新者" AS "作業人員", COALESCE("d"."員工姓名", ' ') AS "作業人員姓名", CAST('4' AS TEXT) AS "來源", 0 AS "庫存相關" FROM "fil004e" AS "a" LEFT JOIN "fil0010" AS "d" ON "d"."員工編號" = "a"."最後更新者" UNION ALL SELECT ' ' AS "單據類別", CONCAT(CAST("a"."歸屬代碼" AS TEXT), ' ', TO_CHAR("a"."最後更新日", 'yyyymmdd'), TO_CHAR("a"."序號", '0000000000')) AS "單據編號", TO_CHAR("a"."最後更新日", 'yyyymmdd') AS "異動日期", "a"."最後更新日", CAST("a"."歸屬代碼" AS TEXT) AS "版銅編號", CAST('調入' AS TEXT) AS "異動類別", ' ' AS "歸屬單別", CAST("a"."版銅代碼" AS TEXT) AS "歸屬單號", ' ' AS "庫別代碼", 0 AS "送修", 0 AS "回廠", "a"."最後更新者" AS "作業人員", COALESCE("d"."員工姓名", ' ') AS "作業人員姓名", CAST('5' AS TEXT) AS "來源", 0 AS "庫存相關" FROM "fil004e" AS "a" LEFT JOIN "fil0010" AS "d" ON "d"."員工編號" = "a"."最後更新者" WHERE "a"."歸屬代碼" <> ' ' UNION ALL SELECT ' ' AS "單據類別", CAST("a"."代碼" AS TEXT) AS "單據編號", CAST(' ' AS TEXT) AS "異動日期", "a"."最後更新日", CAST("a"."代碼" AS TEXT) AS "版銅編號", CAST('建檔' AS TEXT) AS "異動類別", ' ' AS "歸屬單別", CAST("a"."代碼" AS TEXT) AS "歸屬單號", "a"."庫位代碼" AS "庫別代碼", 0 AS "送修", 0 AS "回廠", "a"."最後更新者" AS "作業人員", "a"."更新者姓名" AS "作業人員姓名", CAST('6' AS TEXT) AS "來源", 1 AS "庫存相關" FROM "viewfil3112" AS "a" UNION ALL SELECT ' ' AS "單據類別", CONCAT(CAST("a"."單據編號" AS TEXT), ' ', TO_CHAR("a"."修改日", 'yyyymmdd'), TO_CHAR("a"."序號", '0000000000')) AS "單據編號", TO_CHAR("a"."修改日", 'yyyymmdd') AS "異動日期", "a"."修改日" AS "最後更新日", CAST("a"."單據編號" AS TEXT) AS "版銅編號", CAST('錯誤入庫' AS TEXT) AS "異動類別", ' ' AS "歸屬單別", CAST("a"."單據編號" AS TEXT) AS "歸屬單號", CAST("a"."說明" AS TEXT) AS "庫別代碼", 0 AS "送修", 0 AS "回廠", "a"."修改人" AS "作業人員", COALESCE("d"."員工姓名", ' ') AS "作業人員姓名", CAST('7' AS TEXT) AS "來源", 0 AS "庫存相關" FROM "fil1018" AS "a" LEFT JOIN "fil0010" AS "d" ON "d"."員工編號" = "a"."修改人" WHERE "a"."單據類別" = 'C41.C32E');

-- Home #1780 ViewFIL1027B.版銅庫存資料
CREATE OR REPLACE VIEW "viewfil1027b" AS (SELECT CAST("a"."版銅代碼" AS TEXT) AS "版銅編號", COALESCE("a"."入庫日期", ' ') AS "異動日期", CAST(CASE WHEN POSITION('送修' IN "a"."歸屬流水編號") = 0 THEN '入庫' ELSE '入庫(送修)' END AS TEXT) AS "異動類別", CAST(CONCAT("a"."版銅代碼", ':', "a"."入庫日期", "a"."入庫時間") AS TEXT) AS "單據編號", CAST('3' AS TEXT) AS "來源", "a"."庫別代碼", "a"."最後更新日" FROM "fil004d" AS "a" LEFT JOIN "fil0040" AS "c" ON "c"."單據類別" = 'F33' AND "a"."歸屬流水編號" = "c"."流水編號" WHERE "a"."送修" = 0 UNION ALL SELECT CAST("a"."代碼" AS TEXT) AS "版銅編號", CAST(' ' AS TEXT) AS "異動日期", CAST('建檔' AS TEXT) AS "異動類別", CAST("a"."代碼" AS TEXT) AS "單據編號", CAST('6' AS TEXT) AS "來源", "a"."庫位代碼" AS "庫別代碼", "a"."最後更新日" FROM "viewfil3112" AS "a");

-- Home #1784 ViewFIL2010.異動單主檔_A
CREATE OR REPLACE VIEW "viewfil2010_a" AS (SELECT "a"."單據類別", "a"."單據編號", COALESCE("f"."員工姓名", ' ') AS "填表人姓名", COALESCE("g"."員工姓名", ' ') AS "更新者姓名", COALESCE("h"."簽核狀態", ' ') AS "簽核狀態" FROM "fil0030" AS "a" LEFT JOIN "fil0010" AS "f" ON "a"."填表人" = "f"."員工編號" LEFT JOIN "fil0010" AS "g" ON "a"."最後更新者" = "g"."員工編號" LEFT JOIN "viewofobjproperties" AS "h" ON "a"."流水編號" = "h"."單據流水號");

-- Home #1785 ViewFIL2010.異動單主檔_B
CREATE OR REPLACE VIEW "viewfil2010_b" AS (SELECT "a"."單據類別", "a"."單據編號", "a"."單據日期", "a"."流水編號", "歸屬編號", COALESCE("b"."製程代碼", ' ') AS "製程代碼", COALESCE("h"."簽核狀態", ' ') AS "簽核狀態" FROM "fil0030" AS "a" LEFT JOIN "fil0031" AS "b" ON "a"."單據類別" = "b"."單別" AND "a"."單據編號" = "b"."單號" LEFT JOIN "viewofobjproperties" AS "h" ON "a"."流水編號" = "h"."單據流水號");

-- Home #1787 ViewFIL2021.產品異動數
CREATE OR REPLACE VIEW "viewfil2021" AS (SELECT "a"."單據類別" AS "單別", "a"."單據編號" AS "單號", "a"."單據序號" AS "序號", CASE WHEN "a"."異動日期" = '00000000' THEN "d"."單據日期" ELSE "a"."異動日期" END AS "異動日期", "a"."異動數量", "a"."贈品數量", "a"."產品編號", "a"."單位代碼", "c"."單位代碼" AS "庫存單位", "a"."倉庫代碼", "b"."產品庫存參數" AS "庫存參數", COALESCE("e"."換算率", 1) AS "換算率", ("a"."異動數量" + "a"."贈品數量") * "b"."產品庫存參數" * COALESCE("e"."換算率", 1) AS "異動數" FROM "fil0040" AS "a" INNER JOIN "viewfil0020" AS "b" ON "a"."單據類別" = "b"."單據類別" AND "b"."產品庫存參數" <> 0 INNER JOIN "fil0012" AS "c" ON "a"."產品編號" = "c"."產品編號" INNER JOIN "fil0030" AS "d" ON "a"."單據類別" = "d"."單據類別" AND "a"."單據編號" = "d"."單據編號" LEFT JOIN "viewfil1017" AS "e" ON "a"."單位代碼" = "e"."從" AND "c"."單位代碼" = "e"."到");

-- Home #1794 ViewFIL2050.費用明細檔
CREATE OR REPLACE VIEW "viewfil2050" AS (SELECT "a"."單據類別", "a"."單據編號", "a"."單據序號", "a"."代碼", COALESCE("b"."費用名稱", ' ') AS "名稱", "a"."日期", "a"."幣別", "a"."金額", "a"."稅額", "a"."備註", "a"."付款條件", COALESCE("c"."名稱", ' ') AS "付款條件名稱", "a"."流水編號", "a"."最後更新者", COALESCE("z1"."員工姓名", ' ') AS "更新者姓名", "a"."最後更新日" FROM "fil0042" AS "a" LEFT JOIN "fil0023" AS "b" ON "a"."代碼" = "b"."費用代碼" LEFT JOIN "viewfil3107" AS "c" ON "a"."付款條件" = "c"."代碼" LEFT JOIN "fil0010" AS "z1" ON "a"."最後更新者" = "z1"."員工編號");

-- Home #1807 ViewFIL2070.前製程庫存合計
CREATE OR REPLACE VIEW "viewfil2070" AS (SELECT "a"."製令單別", "a"."製令單號", "a"."半成品編號", "a"."加工別", "a"."製程代碼", MAX("熟成條件") AS "熟成條件", MIN("a"."接頭數") AS "接頭數", SUM("a"."異動數量" * "庫存參數") AS "庫存數量" FROM "viewfil2071" AS "a" GROUP BY "a"."製令單別", "a"."製令單號", "a"."半成品編號", "a"."加工別", "a"."製程代碼");

-- Home #1808 ViewFIL2070A.前製程庫存含製程
CREATE OR REPLACE VIEW "viewfil2070a" AS (SELECT "a"."製令單別", "a"."製令單號", "a"."半成品編號", "a"."加工別", "a"."製程代碼", SUM("a"."異動數量" * "庫存參數") AS "庫存數量" FROM "viewfil2071" AS "a" GROUP BY "a"."製令單別", "a"."製令單號", "a"."半成品編號", "a"."加工別", "a"."製程代碼");

-- Home #1809 ViewFIL2070B.前製程庫存僅加工
CREATE OR REPLACE VIEW "viewfil2070b" AS (SELECT "a"."製令單別", "a"."製令單號", "a"."加工別", "a"."半成品編號", SUM("a"."異動數量" * "庫存參數") AS "庫存數量" FROM "viewfil2071" AS "a" GROUP BY "a"."製令單別", "a"."製令單號", "a"."加工別", "a"."半成品編號");

-- Home #1812 ViewFIL2074.異動主檔備註
CREATE OR REPLACE VIEW "viewfil2074" AS (SELECT "a"."製令單別" AS "單別", "a"."製令單號" AS "單號", "utl_raw".cast_to_nvarchar2(STRING_AGG(CAST(CONCAT("utl_raw".cast_to_raw(CONCAT("a"."備註", (CASE WHEN "a"."相關單號" <> ' ' THEN CONCAT('|', "a"."相關單號") END))), "utl_raw".cast_to_raw(COALESCE("b"."名稱", ' '))) AS TEXT), "utl_raw".cast_to_raw(N'　') ORDER BY "a"."製令單別", "a"."製令單號", "a"."材料序號", "a"."序號")) AS "備註" FROM "fil0037" AS "a" INNER JOIN "fil0030" AS "m" ON "m"."單據類別" = "a"."製令單別" AND "m"."單據編號" = "a"."製令單號" LEFT JOIN "viewfil3103" AS "b" ON "a"."代碼" = "b"."代碼" WHERE "a"."材料序號" = 0 AND "a"."屬性" = '4' GROUP BY "a"."製令單別", "a"."製令單號", "a"."材料序號");

-- Home #1687 ViewFIL3106.庫別代碼
CREATE OR REPLACE VIEW "viewfil3106" AS (SELECT "a"."系統代碼" AS "代碼", "a"."代碼名稱" AS "名稱", "a"."文字參數" AS "說明", "a"."文字參數一" AS "倉別代碼", COALESCE("c"."全稱", ' ') AS "倉別名稱", "c"."廠別編號" AS "廠別編號", COALESCE("c"."廠別名稱", ' ') AS "廠別名稱", CONCAT(COALESCE("c"."全稱", ' '), '.', "a"."代碼名稱") AS "全稱", "a"."數字參數" AS "組別", "a"."最後更新者", COALESCE("b"."員工姓名", ' ') AS "更新者姓名", "a"."最後更新日" FROM "fil1014" AS "a" LEFT JOIN "fil0010" AS "b" ON "b"."員工編號" = "a"."最後更新者" LEFT JOIN "viewfil310r" AS "c" ON "a"."文字參數一" = "c"."代碼" WHERE "a"."代碼類別" = CAST('庫別代碼' AS TEXT));

-- Home #1694 ViewFIL310D.製袋型態
CREATE OR REPLACE VIEW "viewfil310d" AS (SELECT "a"."系統代碼" AS "代碼", "a"."代碼名稱" AS "名稱", "a"."文字參數" AS "說明", COALESCE("c"."名稱", ' ') AS "大類", "a"."最後更新者", COALESCE("b"."員工姓名", ' ') AS "更新者姓名", "a"."最後更新日" FROM "fil1014" AS "a" LEFT JOIN "fil0010" AS "b" ON "b"."員工編號" = "a"."最後更新者" LEFT JOIN "viewfil310s" AS "c" ON "a"."英數參數" = "c"."代碼" WHERE "a"."代碼類別" = CAST('製袋型態' AS TEXT));

-- Home #1706 ViewFIL310P.機台代碼
CREATE OR REPLACE VIEW "viewfil310p" AS (SELECT "a"."系統代碼" AS "代碼", CONCAT(TRIM("a"."代碼名稱"), '(', TRIM("a"."系統代碼"), ')') AS "名稱", "a"."代碼名稱" AS "名稱無代碼", "a"."文字參數" AS "說明", "a"."英數參數" AS "工站", COALESCE("c"."製程工站", ' ') AS "工站名稱", COALESCE("c"."製程代碼", ' ') AS "製程代碼", COALESCE("c"."製程名稱", ' ') AS "製程名稱", CASE WHEN "a"."數字參數" = 0 THEN 0 ELSE 1 END AS "委外", "a"."文字參數一" AS "部門編號", COALESCE(CASE WHEN "a"."數字參數" = 0 THEN "d"."名稱" ELSE "e"."名稱" END, ' ') AS "部門名稱", "a"."文字參數二" AS "庫位代碼", COALESCE("f"."名稱", ' ') AS "庫位名稱", "a"."數字參數二" AS "印刷上蠟版銅", "a"."文字參數三" AS "單位主管流水編號", "a"."文字參數四" AS "檢品主管流水編號", CASE WHEN "a"."數字參數三" = 0 THEN 0 WHEN "a"."數字參數三" <= TO_NUMBER(TO_CHAR(CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, 'YYYYMMDD')) THEN 1 ELSE 0 END AS "停用", "a"."數字參數四" AS "生管排程", "a"."數字參數五" AS "排程順序", "a"."邏輯值" AS "抓取plc資料", "a"."邏輯值一" AS "不需要ccp", "a"."最後更新者", COALESCE("b"."員工姓名", ' ') AS "更新者姓名", "a"."最後更新日" FROM "fil1014" AS "a" LEFT JOIN "fil0010" AS "b" ON "b"."員工編號" = "a"."最後更新者" LEFT JOIN "viewfil310o" AS "c" ON "a"."英數參數" = "c"."代碼" LEFT JOIN "viewfil0012014" AS "d" ON "a"."文字參數一" = "d"."編號" AND "d"."類別" = '1' LEFT JOIN "viewfil0012014" AS "e" ON "a"."文字參數一" = "e"."編號" AND "e"."類別" = '2' LEFT JOIN "viewfil3106" AS "f" ON "a"."文字參數二" = "f"."代碼" WHERE "a"."代碼類別" = CAST('機台代碼' AS TEXT));

-- Home #1707 ViewFIL310Q.工站機台
CREATE OR REPLACE VIEW "viewfil310q" AS (SELECT "a"."工站" AS "工站代碼", "a"."工站名稱", STRING_AGG(CAST(CAST(CONCAT('□', TRIM("a"."代碼")) AS TEXT) AS TEXT), ' ' ORDER BY "a"."代碼") AS "機台代碼", STRING_AGG(CAST(CAST(CONCAT('□', TRIM("a"."名稱")) AS TEXT) AS TEXT), ' ' ORDER BY "a"."代碼") AS "機台名稱" FROM "viewfil310p" AS "a" GROUP BY "a"."工站", "a"."工站名稱");

-- Home #1815 ViewFIL4001.估價單主檔.B01
CREATE OR REPLACE VIEW "viewfil4001" AS (SELECT "a"."單據類別" AS "單別", "a"."單據編號" AS "單號", "a"."單據日期", "a"."公司代碼", COALESCE("k"."全名", ' ') AS "公司名稱", "z1"."部門編號", "a"."簽核系統", COALESCE("z3"."簽核狀態", '0') AS "簽核狀態", "a"."簽核系統_結案", "a"."廠客編號" AS "客戶編號", COALESCE("b2"."說明一", ' ') AS "客戶簡稱", COALESCE("b2"."說明一", ' ') AS "客戶全名", "a"."廠客單號" AS "產品編號", "b1"."產品名稱", "b1"."高", "b1"."寬", "b1"."長", "a"."備註", "a"."業務員", COALESCE("f"."員工姓名", ' ') AS "業務員姓名", "a"."幣別代碼", COALESCE("g"."名稱", ' ') AS "幣別名稱", "b"."聯絡人序號", COALESCE("b2"."說明二", ' ') AS "地址", COALESCE("b2"."說明三", ' ') AS "聯絡人", COALESCE(CASE WHEN COALESCE("b2"."說明五", ' ') = ' ' THEN "c"."電話" ELSE "b2"."說明五" END, ' ') AS "電話", COALESCE("c"."分機", ' ') AS "分機", COALESCE("c"."職務", ' ') AS "職務", COALESCE(CASE WHEN COALESCE("b2"."說明四", ' ') = ' ' THEN "c"."email" ELSE "b2"."說明四" END, ' ') AS "email", COALESCE("c"."行動電話", ' ') AS "行動電話", "b1"."單價", "b1"."購買數量", "b1"."製版費", "b1"."燙金費", COALESCE("b1"."單價" * "b1"."購買數量" + "b1"."製版費" + "b1"."燙金費", 0) AS "未稅價格", CASE WHEN "b1"."成捲製袋" = 'A' THEN '成捲品' ELSE '製袋品' END AS "成捲製袋", "a"."流水編號", "a"."填表人", COALESCE("z1"."員工姓名", ' ') AS "填表人姓名", COALESCE("z1"."serial_num", ' ') AS "員工流水編號", "a"."填表日", "a"."最後更新者", COALESCE("z2"."員工姓名", ' ') AS "更新者姓名", "a"."最後更新日" FROM "fil0030" AS "a" LEFT JOIN "fil0031" AS "b" ON "a"."單據類別" = "b"."單別" AND "a"."單據編號" = "b"."單號" INNER JOIN "fil003i" AS "b1" ON "a"."單據類別" = "b1"."單別" AND "a"."單據編號" = "b1"."單號" INNER JOIN "fil0038" AS "b2" ON "a"."單據類別" = "b2"."單別" AND "a"."單據編號" = "b2"."單號" LEFT JOIN "viewfil1015a" AS "c" ON "a"."廠客編號" = "c"."編號" AND "b"."聯絡人序號" = "c"."序號" LEFT JOIN "fil0011" AS "e" ON "a"."廠客編號" = "e"."編號" LEFT JOIN "fil0010" AS "f" ON "a"."業務員" = "f"."員工編號" LEFT JOIN "viewfil3102" AS "g" ON "a"."幣別代碼" = "g"."代碼" LEFT JOIN "viewfil0011" AS "k" ON "a"."公司代碼" = "k"."代碼" LEFT JOIN "fil0010" AS "z1" ON "a"."填表人" = "z1"."員工編號" LEFT JOIN "fil0010" AS "z2" ON "a"."最後更新者" = "z2"."員工編號" LEFT JOIN "viewofobjproperties" AS "z3" ON "a"."流水編號" = "z3"."單據流水號" WHERE "a"."單據類別" = 'B01');

-- Home #1819 ViewFIL4010.報價單主檔.B11
CREATE OR REPLACE VIEW "viewfil4010" AS (SELECT "a"."單據類別" AS "單別", "a"."單據編號" AS "單號", "a"."單據日期", "a"."公司代碼", COALESCE("k"."全名", ' ') AS "公司名稱", "a"."簽核系統", "a"."簽核系統_結案", "a"."廠客編號", COALESCE("e"."簡稱", ' ') AS "廠客簡稱", COALESCE("e"."全名", COALESCE("j"."說明一", ' ')) AS "廠客全名", "a"."備註", CASE WHEN "a"."業務員" = ' ' THEN "a"."填表人" ELSE "a"."業務員" END AS "業務員", COALESCE("f"."員工姓名", ' ') AS "業務員姓名", "a"."幣別代碼", COALESCE("g"."名稱", ' ') AS "幣別名稱", "a"."稅別", "a"."稅率", "b"."類別", "b"."材積單位" AS "交貨日期_天", "b"."交貨日期", "b"."交貨日期_次批", "b"."運輸方式" AS "交貨數量正負", "b"."交貨日期_天" AS "交貨數量差", "b"."數量" AS "訂金率", "b"."訂金", "b"."票期", "a"."歸屬序號" AS "有效期限", "b"."聯絡人序號", "b"."材料編號一" AS "產品編號", "b"."文字1" AS "品名", "b"."文字2" AS "規格", "b"."文數字11" AS "材質1", "b"."文數字12" AS "材質2", "b"."文數字13" AS "材質3", "b"."文數字14" AS "材質4", "b"."文數字15" AS "材質5", "b"."文字6" AS "材質6", "b"."數值1" AS "厚度1", "b"."數值2" AS "厚度2", "b"."數值3" AS "厚度3", "b"."數值4" AS "厚度4", "b"."數值5" AS "厚度5", "b"."數值6" AS "厚度6", "b"."文數字1" AS "色別1", "b"."文數字2" AS "色別2", "b"."文數字3" AS "色別3", "b"."文數字4" AS "色別4", "b"."文數字5" AS "色別5", "b"."文數字6" AS "色別6", "b"."文數字7" AS "色別7", "b"."文數字8" AS "色別8", "b"."文數字9" AS "色別9", "b"."文數字10" AS "色別10", COALESCE("j"."說明三", COALESCE("c"."聯絡人", ' ')) AS "聯絡人", COALESCE("b"."材料編號二", ' ') AS "電話", COALESCE("b"."材料編號三", ' ') AS "傳真", COALESCE("c"."分機", ' ') AS "分機", COALESCE("c"."職務", ' ') AS "職務", COALESCE("c"."email", ' ') AS "email", COALESCE("c"."行動電話", ' ') AS "行動電話", "b"."送貨地址序號", COALESCE("j"."說明三", COALESCE("d"."收貨人", ' ')) AS "收貨人", COALESCE("j"."說明二", COALESCE("d"."地址", ' ')) AS "收貨地址", COALESCE("j"."說明四", COALESCE("d"."地址", ' ')) AS "工廠地址", COALESCE("d"."電話", ' ') AS "收貨電話", CASE WHEN COALESCE("i"."回簽", 0) = 0 THEN 0 ELSE 1 END AS "客戶回簽", CASE WHEN COALESCE("l"."佐證", 0) = 0 THEN 0 ELSE 1 END AS "客戶佐證", "a"."流水編號", "a"."填表人", COALESCE("z1"."員工姓名", ' ') AS "填表人姓名", "a"."填表日", "a"."最後更新者", COALESCE("z2"."員工姓名", ' ') AS "更新者姓名", "a"."最後更新日", COALESCE("z3"."簽核狀態", '0') AS "簽核狀態", COALESCE("h"."發函代理人", ' ') AS "發函代理人", COALESCE("h"."代理人姓名", ' ') AS "代理人姓名", COALESCE("e"."合約訂單是否歸屬總公司", 0) AS "不用回簽報價單" FROM "fil0030" AS "a" INNER JOIN "fil0031" AS "b" ON "a"."單據類別" = "b"."單別" AND "a"."單據編號" = "b"."單號" LEFT JOIN "viewfil1015a" AS "c" ON "a"."廠客編號" = "c"."編號" AND "b"."聯絡人序號" = "c"."序號" LEFT JOIN "fil0015" AS "d" ON "a"."廠客編號" = "d"."廠客編號" AND "b"."送貨地址序號" = "d"."序號" LEFT JOIN "fil0011" AS "e" ON "a"."廠客編號" = "e"."編號" LEFT JOIN "fil0010" AS "f" ON CASE WHEN "a"."業務員" = ' ' THEN "a"."填表人" ELSE "a"."業務員" END = "f"."員工編號" LEFT JOIN "viewfil3102" AS "g" ON "a"."幣別代碼" = "g"."代碼" LEFT JOIN "viewfil0030" AS "h" ON "a"."簽核系統" = "h"."簽核系統" AND "a"."單據編號" = "h"."單號" LEFT JOIN (SELECT "a"."簽核系統", "a"."單據編號", COUNT("a"."單據編號") AS "回簽" FROM "viewfil0052" AS "a" GROUP BY "a"."簽核系統", "a"."單據編號") AS "i" ON "a"."簽核系統" = "i"."簽核系統" AND "a"."單據編號" = "i"."單據編號" LEFT JOIN "fil0038" AS "j" ON "a"."流水編號" = "j"."流水編號" AND "a"."流水編號" <> ' ' LEFT JOIN "viewfil0011" AS "k" ON "a"."公司代碼" = "k"."代碼" LEFT JOIN (SELECT "a"."簽核系統", "a"."單號", COUNT("a"."單號") AS "佐證" FROM "viewfil0051" AS "a" GROUP BY "a"."簽核系統", "a"."單號") AS "l" ON CONCAT(TRIM("a"."簽核系統"), '_A') = "l"."簽核系統" AND "a"."單據編號" = "l"."單號" LEFT JOIN "fil0010" AS "z1" ON "a"."填表人" = "z1"."員工編號" LEFT JOIN "fil0010" AS "z2" ON "a"."最後更新者" = "z2"."員工編號" LEFT JOIN "viewofobjproperties" AS "z3" ON "a"."流水編號" = "z3"."單據流水號" WHERE "a"."單據類別" = 'B11');

-- Home #1823 ViewFIL401B.報價明細選擇表
CREATE OR REPLACE VIEW "viewfil401b" AS (SELECT "a"."單據類別" AS "單別", "a"."單據編號" AS "單號", "a"."單據序號" AS "序號", CASE WHEN "f"."類別" = 'A' THEN '新品' WHEN "f"."類別" = 'B' THEN '重覆訂單' WHEN "f"."類別" = 'C' THEN '改版' ELSE '其他' END AS "類別名稱", "a"."備註說明" AS "備註", CONCAT('倍率:', TRIM(TO_CHAR("d"."折讓", '990.00')), ' ', '單價:', TRIM(TO_CHAR(CASE WHEN "a"."異動數量" = 0 THEN 0 ELSE "a"."數值1" END, '99,990.00')), ' ', '數量:', TRIM(TO_CHAR("a"."異動數量", '999,999')), ' ', '未稅金額:', TRIM(TO_CHAR("a"."異動金額", '9,999,999'))) AS "產品編號", "a"."異動金額" AS "總價", "a"."製版費", "m"."流水編號", "m"."單據日期", "m"."廠客編號", COALESCE("e"."全名", COALESCE("j"."說明一", ' ')) AS "廠客全名", "f"."文字1" AS "品名", COALESCE("z3"."簽核狀態", '0') AS "簽核狀態", CASE WHEN COALESCE("i"."回簽", 0) = 0 THEN 0 ELSE 1 END AS "客戶回簽", CASE WHEN COALESCE("l"."佐證", 0) = 0 THEN 0 ELSE 1 END AS "客戶佐證", "m"."稅別", "m"."幣別代碼" FROM "fil0040" AS "a" INNER JOIN "fil0030" AS "m" ON "m"."單據類別" = "a"."單據類別" AND "m"."單據編號" = "a"."單據編號" INNER JOIN "fil004g" AS "c" ON "c"."單別" = "a"."單據類別" AND "c"."單號" = "a"."單據編號" AND "c"."序號" = "a"."單據序號" INNER JOIN "fil0031" AS "f" ON "f"."單別" = "a"."單據類別" AND "f"."單號" = "a"."單據編號" INNER JOIN "viewofobjproperties" AS "z3" ON "m"."流水編號" = "z3"."單據流水號" AND "z3"."簽核狀態" = 'E' LEFT JOIN "fil0040" AS "d" ON "c"."估價流水編號" = "d"."流水編號" AND "a"."qrno" = "d"."單據序號" LEFT JOIN "fil0011" AS "e" ON "m"."廠客編號" = "e"."編號" LEFT JOIN "fil0038" AS "j" ON "m"."流水編號" = "j"."流水編號" AND "m"."流水編號" <> ' ' LEFT JOIN (SELECT "a"."簽核系統", "a"."單號", COUNT("a"."單號") AS "回簽" FROM "fil1011" AS "a" GROUP BY "a"."簽核系統", "a"."單號") AS "i" ON TRIM("m"."簽核系統") = "i"."簽核系統" AND "a"."單據編號" = "i"."單號" LEFT JOIN (SELECT "a"."簽核系統", "a"."單號", COUNT("a"."單號") AS "佐證" FROM "fil1011" AS "a" GROUP BY "a"."簽核系統", "a"."單號") AS "l" ON CONCAT(TRIM("m"."簽核系統"), '_A') = "l"."簽核系統" AND "a"."單據編號" = "l"."單號" WHERE "a"."單據類別" = 'B11' AND (COALESCE("i"."回簽", 0) > 0 OR COALESCE("l"."佐證", 0) > 0));

-- Home #1827 ViewFIL4020.客戶訂單主檔.B31
