CREATE OR REPLACE VIEW "viewfil404z5" AS (SELECT "b"."批號", SUM("a"."異動數量" * COALESCE("e"."換算率", 1)) AS "領用數量" FROM "fil0040" AS "a" INNER JOIN "fil0041" AS "b" ON "a"."單據類別" = "b"."單別" AND "a"."單據編號" = "b"."單號" AND "a"."單據序號" = "b"."序號" LEFT JOIN "fil0012" AS "c" ON "a"."產品編號" = "c"."產品編號" /* 單位換算 */ LEFT JOIN "viewfil1017" AS "e" ON "a"."單位代碼" = "e"."從" AND "c"."單位代碼" = "e"."到" WHERE "a"."單據類別" = 'C41' AND "a"."異動類別" = 'C' AND "a"."異動數量" <> 0 GROUP BY "b"."批號");

